Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.56,0:12:30.22,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新短消息：迪伦）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:26.29,1:24:27.37,Note,0,0,0,0,,（愚者）
Dialogue: 0,1:54:20.20,1:54:22.83,Note,0,0,0,0,,（格林威治天文台）
Dialogue: 0,1:26:41.86,1:26:43.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（你看了这个吗？）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.77,0:04:56.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（地铁 往曼哈顿）
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.24,0:07:16.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（联邦调查局 司法部门）
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.16,0:32:17.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（睡吧）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.62,0:39:58.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（纽堡联邦监狱 联邦惩教所）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.63,0:40:48.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（囚犯宣称遭陷害）
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.09,0:40:50.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我是受害者 撒迪厄斯·布兰德利）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.43,0:18:46.60,Note,0,0,0,0,,（服务器离线 勿进）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.02,0:16:07.82,Note,0,0,0,0,,（奥克塔）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.11,0:43:50.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.73,0:43:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 不要吵 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:27.23,0:44:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位先生说他要塑料的 所有道具
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.31,0:44:30.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,塑料道具
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.21,0:44:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,塑料
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.64,0:44:35.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他谁啊 这也太差了
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.64,0:44:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,傻瓜 就算你
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.44,0:44:57.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是听不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.52,0:58:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的衣服脱掉
Dialogue: 0,0:58:53.84,0:58:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 伸手
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.48,0:58:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,请抬你的手
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.28,0:59:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你转身
Dialogue: 0,0:59:03.71,0:59:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手伸出来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:09.69,0:59:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要乱动 别耍花样
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.96,0:59:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,请转身
Dialogue: 0,0:59:15.50,0:59:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:59:44.35,0:59:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边走
Dialogue: 0,0:59:56.78,0:59:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.77,0:59:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你赶快抬身
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.27,1:00:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来 小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.90,1:00:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,举手 举手
Dialogue: 0,1:00:06.27,1:00:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,张开你的手
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.18,1:00:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.87,1:00:15.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手 举起手
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.71,1:00:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一边
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.38,1:01:02.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 你们干嘛？
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.86,1:01:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢转个身过来
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.18,1:01:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身 伸手啊
Dialogue: 0,1:01:11.21,1:01:12.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢慢转身
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.62,1:01:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,别乱动
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.16,1:01:34.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有发现
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.59,1:02:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边有四个人要出来了 准备进行检查
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.78,1:02:27.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备过去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.25,1:02:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别捣乱了 快过去
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.48,1:02:51.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 下一个
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.68,1:04:15.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没死啊？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.95,1:04:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.14,1:04:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你 做了什么好事把你放出来了？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:29.82,1:04:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,见过他们吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:04:31.92,1:04:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的孙儿跟他
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.00,1:04:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的头说了话
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.77,1:04:37.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在里边
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.77,1:04:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来
Dialogue: 0,1:04:47.53,1:04:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你的普通话讲的好
Dialogue: 0,1:04:50.32,1:04:51.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会跟你讲
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.24,1:04:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,活该 你来不来呀
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.00,1:04:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,来啦
Dialogue: 0,1:04:57.72,1:04:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,李儿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.21,1:05:01.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,李儿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:02.51,1:05:04.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,李儿你在哪里呀？
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.52,1:05:06.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,李儿
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.65,1:07:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父亲
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.52,1:07:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我把这个给你
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.74,1:07:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:07:35.19,1:07:37.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚他们不是两个人吗？
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.79,1:26:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干杯 - 干杯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.09,0:04:48.72,Title,0,0,0,0,,《惊天魔盗团2》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:37.78,Note,0,0,0,0,,（新泽西 1984年）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.13,0:29:46.43,Note,0,0,0,0,,（未知来电）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.90,0:37:10.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我们的澳门之旅）
Dialogue: 0,1:07:43.91,1:07:45.66,Note,0,0,0,0,,（换你出招了）
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.19,1:08:23.74,Note,0,0,0,0,,（氹仔市场）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.44,0:00:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Sorry. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. Coming through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.78,0:00:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 魔术师莱昂内尔·施莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, so-called magician Lionel Shrike{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.26,0:00:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,将通过表演他所说的「不可能的表演」\N{\fnArial\fs30}is making another sad attempt for attention{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.54,0:00:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次吸引观众们的目光\N{\fnArial\fs30}by performing what he calls an impossible feat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.96,0:00:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,保险箱是由最坚固的钢铁打造\N{\fnArial\fs30}The safe is made of the strongest iron.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.42,0:00:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法被锯断 也不能烧穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't be sawed through or pried.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.63,0:00:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但莱昂内尔·施莱克依然认为自己能逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yet, Lionel Shrike thinks he's able to escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.01,0:00:58.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.35,0:01:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 你来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, buddy. You made it, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.77,0:01:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到那边的座位了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, see that seat there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.23,0:01:08.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是全场最好的位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the best seat in the house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.81,0:01:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道莱昂内尔·施莱克真的能从中脱身？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Lionel Shrike the kind of magician who can pull this off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.11,0:01:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是他只是脑子进水了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is he actually in over his head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.07,0:01:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拭目以待\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll see about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.74,0:01:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我不想让你去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the matter? - I don't want you to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.16,0:01:22.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 好了 我们说过的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, come on. We talked about this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.41,0:01:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗？这是我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember? This is what I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.79,0:01:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要证明那些唱反调的人是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to prove all those naysayers wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.37,0:01:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? Besides…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.25,0:01:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次都会给自己留一手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always keep something up my sleeve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.38,0:01:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 跟爸爸对表？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, got your watch like your dad's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.22,0:01:39.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多少秒？- 300秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. How many seconds? - Three hundred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.10,0:01:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,300秒 可能还要快一些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three hundred. Maybe a few less.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. I love you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.81,0:01:51.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 再见 大小伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. See you later, big man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 有请莱昂内尔·施莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, Lionel Shrike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.99,0:01:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能够摈住呼吸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will he be able to hold his breath?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.03,0:02:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能逃出保险箱吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will he be able to somehow escape the safe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,3 2 1…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three, two, one…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.92,0:02:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,2 3…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two, three, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.42,0:02:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,4 5 6 7 8…\N{\fnArial\fs30}four, five, six, seven, eight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.89,0:02:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,296… 297 298 299 300\N{\fnArial\fs30}296… 297, 298, 299, 300.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.36,0:02:35.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,303 304…\N{\fnArial\fs30}303, 304…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.14,0:02:37.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经5分钟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's five minutes now, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.86,0:02:43.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是未看到或是听到 任何莱昂内尔·施莱克的动静\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have not seen or heard anything from Lionel Shrike yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.41,0:02:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.91,0:02:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:54.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.92,0:02:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.96,0:02:59.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}NO! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.34,0:03:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.55,0:03:04.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:26.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.95,0:03:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不会说谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}It may not lie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.95,0:03:32.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别以为它不能被谎言蒙蔽\N{\fnArial\fs30}But don't think for a moment that it can't be lied to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.25,0:03:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所见即所信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing is believing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.17,0:03:39.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是真相吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But is it truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:43.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们把骑士当做高贵的罗宾汉 他们是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}People see the Horsemen as noble Robin Hoods. Are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.72,0:03:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是他们只是普通的贼？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or are they common thieves?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.97,0:03:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要看你从哪个角度去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on your point of view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只知道 他们从拉斯维加斯的舞台上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.10,0:03:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,抢劫了一家位于巴黎的银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}They robbed a bank in Paris from a stage in Las Vegas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.77,0:03:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们从一个保险巨头身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They fleeced an insurance magnate{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.48,0:03:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,卷走了数亿美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}of hundreds of millions of dollars{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.11,0:04:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后在纽约的一个屋顶上消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and disappeared from a roof in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:05.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是让最忠诚的支持者 沐浴在金钱之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always showering their devoted fans with money.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.16,0:04:07.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来是你不知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's what you don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.12,0:04:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们留下了一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They left one man behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.33,0:04:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他被关了起来 替他们背黑锅 那就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Framed. Holding the bag. Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.38,0:04:16.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在听吗 骑士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you listening, Horsemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.79,0:04:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你们出现 你们愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you emerge, and you will, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.05,0:04:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会等着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be there waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:29.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,记住我的话 你会遭到报应的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because mark my words, you will get what's coming to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.47,0:04:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,以你想象不到的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}In ways you can't expect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.69,0:04:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,但绝对是你应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But very much deserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.94,0:04:41.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我相信一件事 以眼还眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because one thing I believe in is an eye for an eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.19,0:06:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 丹尼尔·阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Daniel Atlas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.15,0:06:03.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪位跟我讲话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who am I speaking to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.86,0:06:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看天眼的幕后者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked to see the face behind all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.86,0:06:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你问了很多问题 而且满腹牢骚\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've asked many questions. And registered many complaints.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.37,0:06:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心 我们都听到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can rest assured that we've heard you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.37,0:06:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吗？因为我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you? Because I don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.95,0:06:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 信任？- 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Trust? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.37,0:06:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的领袖？你手下的骑士？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your leader? Your fellow Horsemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.17,0:06:21.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps even us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.71,0:06:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我讨厌我们已经隐姓埋名生活了一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like that we've been living in hiding for a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.76,0:06:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不喜欢每次听到迪伦的消息 内容都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like that every message I get from Dylan is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.05,0:06:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,「等待 要耐心 天眼自有计划」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Wait. Be patient. The Eye has a plan."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.48,0:06:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,等待 要耐心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Be patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.22,0:06:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼自有计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Eye has a plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.52,0:06:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个游戏 我不想玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is games and it's not working for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.14,0:06:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得应该是你来带领骑士们 而不是迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}You feel it is you who should be leading the Horsemen, not Dylan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.32,0:06:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那就是你要的 那就坚持下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If that is what you desire, stay the course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.11,0:06:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你独特的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust that your unique talents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.20,0:06:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,伟大的思想不会被埋没\N{\fnArial\fs30}and remarkable mind will not go unrecognized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.08,0:06:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有个新任务给骑士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have a new mission for the Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.75,0:06:59.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦有个计划 而且很快就会召唤你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan has a plan and will gather you together soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:02.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now leave!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.72,0:07:19.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,北卡罗来纳 佛罗里达 马里兰 缅因\N{\fnArial\fs30}…North Carolina, Florida, Maryland, Maine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,整个东海岸都包括了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking the entire eastern seaboard.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.56,0:07:23.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要看到结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to see some results.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.56,0:07:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 嘿 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey. Oh, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.44,0:07:27.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,稍微打扰一下 能占用你们几分钟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just real quick. Can I have you for a couple of minutes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.57,0:07:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我正在忙 迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right in the middle of something, Dylan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.28,0:07:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 没事的 嘿 大伙儿 抱歉 抱歉打扰了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I know. It's okay. Hey. Hey, everybody. Sorry. Sorry about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.38,0:07:34.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,打电话给市长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call the mayor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.37,0:07:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 双胞胎？不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks a lot. Twins, huh? Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.58,0:07:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he coming?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.08,0:07:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 要不是非常重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I wouldn't have brought you out of that meeting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.25,0:07:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会打断你的会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless it was something important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.79,0:07:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,是关于骑士们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about the Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有事情发生了 而且现在正在发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somethings happening here and it's happening now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.46,0:07:51.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,网络留言板上 精英魔术团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Message boards. Elite magic society.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,里面有关于骑士的讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is chatter going on about the Horsemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.76,0:07:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且和奥克塔有关 软件巨头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and something happening with Octa, the giant software company.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.10,0:07:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道奥克塔是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what Octa is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.18,0:07:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 女士 但两个月前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, ma'am, but two months ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.93,0:08:01.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们派人去费城了 就因为他自以为知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we sent men to Philadelphia because he knew…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.98,0:08:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我说了那次我错了 - 他知道骑士们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I said that I was wrong. - He knew that the Horsemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.35,0:08:05.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,会攻击欧洲大西洋银行峰会\N{\fnArial\fs30}were going to hit the Euro-Atlantic Banking Summit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.02,0:08:07.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有证据 - 让他说完\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have proof. - Let him talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.11,0:08:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 通讯往来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Communications.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为其中一方是丹尼尔·阿特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Contact between who I think might be Daniel Atlas{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.49,0:08:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一方很可能是梅里特·麦金尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and who may be Merritt McKinney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.24,0:08:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么证据 电子邮件 手机 有手稿吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what do you have? Emails? Cell phones? Any transcripts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.66,0:08:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鸽子 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pigeons. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.91,0:08:24.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你是说鸽子密探吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, you mean stool pigeons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.29,0:08:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我说的就是鸽子 真正的鸽子 就像信鸽那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I mean actual pigeon pigeons. Like carrier pigeons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.00,0:08:29.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗？魔术师变戏法都用的信鸽 - 白鸽\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? Magicians work with pigeons. - Doves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.17,0:08:32.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有只鸽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}This pigeon, right here…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.84,0:08:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是丹尼尔·阿特拉斯 同一只鸽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Daniel Atlas. Same pigeon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.51,0:08:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,东村\N{\fnArial\fs30}East Village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.68,0:08:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的鸽子 西村\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same pigeon, West Village.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.35,0:08:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,42大街 鸽子 65大街\N{\fnArial\fs30}42nd Street, pigeon. 65th Street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.19,0:08:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直到乔治·华盛顿大桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the way up to the George Washington Bridge{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.15,0:08:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟一个和梅里特·麦金尼长得一模一样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}on a sail boat with a guy that looks just like Merritt McKinney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.82,0:08:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切有什么含义？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what does this all mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那意思是什么 没有任何含义 都是瞎扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what it means. It means nothing. It's bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.82,0:08:57.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能换个调调吗 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could you sing a new song? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.62,0:08:59.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那次呢 两年前你差点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it that two years ago you were so close…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.70,0:09:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我独自行动就是为了 毁掉我自己的调查吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I went out of my way to screw up my own investigation?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.41,0:09:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为我是大白痴？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm that big of an idiot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.66,0:09:05.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自以为很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I think now? I think you're smart, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:06.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其他所有人都认为你是蠢货\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you want everybody else to think that you're an idiot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.50,0:09:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 住口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,考恩 虽然我是新来的 但我看得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cowan, I know I'm new here, but as far as I can tell, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.67,0:09:13.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,连根本不认识你的人都觉得 你是个混球\N{\fnArial\fs30}people who don't even know you, think you're an asshole.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.93,0:09:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有你 - 长官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And you? - Ma'am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.39,0:09:20.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不认识我 但我在警校的第一年 你来发表过讲话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know me, but my first year in the Academy, you gave a talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.39,0:09:24.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你称为「持久游戏」 你谈到道德准则\N{\fnArial\fs30}The "long game" you called it. You talked about a moral compass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.89,0:09:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,说你相信自己的道德准则永远不会改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}About how you believed in yours immutably.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.90,0:09:34.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我当时心想 那个人 总有一天 我要跟他一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought to myself, "That guy. One day, I want to be that guy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.86,0:09:38.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在 一只鸽子？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now… A pigeon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.49,0:09:40.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,严格来说是几只鸽子 但我明白你的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically, it was a few pigeons, but I hear what you're saying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.66,0:09:42.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我就这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So here's what I'm going to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.37,0:09:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,放你几天假 自己去追鸽子把\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to take a vacation day? Go on your own? Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.46,0:09:48.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我不会再浪费人力物力陪你捕风捉影了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not going to devote resources to another snipe hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.83,0:09:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来清理烂摊子 不是来添乱的 非常抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to clean this mess up, not add to it. I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:55.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,头 谢谢 我保证 这绝不是捕风捉影的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boss, thank you. I promise you, it won't be a snipe hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.59,0:09:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会抓住那些骑士的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get those Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.05,0:09:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她人真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 每个人都有两张脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The problem is when you're two people at the same time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.47,0:10:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,总有一天会被撕破的\N{\fnArial\fs30}one of them is bound to trip the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.02,0:10:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了那个时候 我在那儿看着你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when that happens, I will be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.85,0:10:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,牢记在心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duly noted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.50,0:10:32.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 嗨 - 你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. Hi! - Who are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.17,0:10:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在我家干什么 - 说起来挺有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing in my… - It's actually a funny story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.92,0:10:35.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么进来的？哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you get into my apartment? Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.45,0:10:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得挺有趣 但其实不是 让人「哈哈」的那种有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's funny. It's not like funny "ha ha."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.97,0:10:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不是你想象的那种「哈哈」的有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you might not think that it's funny "ha ha."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.18,0:10:42.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得有趣 因为我觉得 这一切都是相关的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it's funny. I guess it's all kind of relative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.51,0:10:44.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实 不 不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was actually… No, that's not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.51,0:10:48.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我先搬到附近住 现在到了这里 也许…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made myself in the neighborhood and now I'm here, and maybe…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.98,0:10:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.15,0:10:53.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 你是怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, how did you get in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.44,0:10:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是疯狂的粉丝吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you some kind of crazed fan or something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.90,0:10:57.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不 不 不 我认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. No, no, no, I recognize you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.90,0:11:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你表演了那个二流的极客魔术对吗 你从…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did that B-grade "geek magic" thing, didn't you? You pulled a…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.16,0:11:02.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,从兔子里拉出一顶帽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pulled a hat out of the rabbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.45,0:11:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,从兔子身上拉出帽子 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}A hat out of the rabbit, that's right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.74,0:11:04.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道那样不能成功\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that it didn't work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.91,0:11:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it was actually kind of disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.08,0:11:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但兔子不介意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was way worse for the rabbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.58,0:11:11.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的破绽明显 道具也很差劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, your drop was obvious and your body shell is flimsy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.08,0:11:14.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你不介意的话 从我沙发下面爬出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you wouldn't mind crawling out from under my couch and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗒嗒 我现在坐在这咯 疯啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da! Now I'm sitting over here. Crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.80,0:11:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便说一句 那个兔子戏法？那都是8年前了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, that rabbit thing? That was eight years ago, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.55,0:11:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这几年进步了很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've gotten so much better since then.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.31,0:11:27.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.72,0:11:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 过来 你想要做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come here. What is it that you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.31,0:11:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想见你 当然人人都想\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to meet you. Everybody, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.02,0:11:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想成为「天眼」的一员 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be a part of the Eye, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 而且我想用我的魔术做好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said it. I do. And I want to use my magic for good, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.48,0:11:39.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像你和梅里特 特别是杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}like you and Merritt and Jack especially.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:41.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我知道那个杰克还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's right. I know that Jack is alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.32,0:11:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他伪装了自己的死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that he faked his own death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.66,0:11:45.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我超喜欢假死 太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am a huge fan of faking deaths. That was crazy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.62,0:11:47.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么？车夫结？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this? A trucker's hitch?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.24,0:11:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 打的太差劲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - It's terrible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.08,0:11:51.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真丢脸 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Embarrassing. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.25,0:11:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 真遗憾亨利离开你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I am so sorry that Henley left you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.47,0:11:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 天啊 - 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ow! God! - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.17,0:11:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样其实更好点 知道我听说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's actually a little better. You know what I heard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.84,0:11:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 关于亨利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - About Henley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.05,0:12:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说 她厌倦了等待\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard that she got tired of waiting around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.63,0:12:05.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,她失去了信仰要求退出\N{\fnArial\fs30}She lost faith and so she asked for an out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.22,0:12:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天眼就满足了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Eye gave it to her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.18,0:12:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但谁知道呢 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who knows, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.51,0:12:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,内心想法这东西很难说\N{\fnArial\fs30}In matters of the heart, so difficult to tell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.56,0:12:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许她只是厌倦你了 有想过那种可能吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe she got sick of you. You ever think about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.10,0:12:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制欲？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Control issues?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.52,0:12:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能你把她绑得不够紧 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you just didn't tie her up tight enough. Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.36,0:12:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 接下来会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Here's what's going to happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.82,0:12:20.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你最好呆在这里 闭上嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to stay here and stop talking, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.19,0:12:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打个电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm going to make a phone call, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.74,0:12:24.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,在5分钟之内会有人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}and in about five minutes, some people are going…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.62,0:12:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 发力都在手腕上 - 嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's all in the wrist. - Uh-huh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.83,0:12:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,让卡片的冲力替你完成工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let the momentum of the card do the work for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.96,0:12:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯哼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm-hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.17,0:12:38.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后这一张我叫做「旋转」\N{\fnArial\fs30}This last one I call the Stall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.72,0:12:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.75,0:12:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在想看个美妙的东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you want to see a thing of beauty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.09,0:12:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想啊 - 走你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I do indeed. - Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.89,0:12:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,噼里啪啦砰\N{\fnArial\fs30}And bingo bango bongo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.06,0:12:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 挺好的 虽然\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. No, no, no, it's good to be positive{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一年半点进步都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}despite making zero progress in a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.48,0:12:56.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.60,0:12:58.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在催眠术方面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whereas when it comes to hypnotism, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.61,0:13:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,学生几乎就要出师了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the student has almost become the master.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.11,0:13:05.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你的自信 但你可以说你有更好的老师\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your confidence, but you might say that you have the better teacher.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.78,0:13:06.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 噢 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ooh! - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.95,0:13:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right. You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.24,0:13:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的老师绝对不知道他自己在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your teacher definitely doesn't know what he's doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.58,0:13:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,顺便问一下 这是你昨天的卡牌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, was this your card yesterday?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.58,0:13:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 我想也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In fact it was. - I thought so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.04,0:13:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不赖\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.71,0:13:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我能在你用卡牌打中丹尼之前 催眠他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I can hypnotize Danny before you hit him with a card, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.17,0:13:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让我睡一星期上铺\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get top bunk for a week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.55,0:13:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, that's a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.55,0:13:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹尼 最近好嗎？- 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Danny, what's up, man? - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.05,0:13:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,盯着你的手掌 随着你的视线移动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stare at the palm of your hand and as your eyes change focus, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.10,0:13:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会开始意识到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}you will begin to notice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.52,0:13:33.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么说 我没被催眠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything, because I'm not hypnotized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.60,0:13:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我不起作用的 求你别变得跟他一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working. Please don't become him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.73,0:13:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你们在没有女人的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know you guys did party tricks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.48,0:13:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然会耍派对上取乐的这些小花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}when there weren't floozies around to impress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.23,0:13:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在大概1937年的时候就不再\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I think we stopped trying to impress floozies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.57,0:13:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,以让女人动心为目标了\N{\fnArial\fs30}in, like, 1937.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.78,0:13:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 有人闯进了我的公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, somebody broke into my apartment, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.90,0:13:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那菜鸟了解我的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some amateur who knew everything about me, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.74,0:13:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解亨利离开的一切 还有我们的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything about Henley leaving, and everything about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:54.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是她 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's her. - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.12,0:13:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 你见过鲁拉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - You met Lula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:58.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,见过了 她在这干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've met her. What is she doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.04,0:14:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是新骑士 女骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the new Horseman! I'm the girl Horseman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.21,0:14:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.80,0:14:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,耶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.01,0:14:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,没人激动吗 杰克 不表示下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody. No excitement. Jack? Anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.60,0:14:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 告诉我这里是什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, tell me what's going on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.64,0:14:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁拉过去10年都在做幕后工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Lula's been on the underground scene for the last decade, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.31,0:14:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得她是有真才实学的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I think she has some real talent, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.02,0:14:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想让她走上台前\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'd like to try her on stage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来平衡一下阳盛阴衰 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to balance out the duo. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.32,0:14:24.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是认真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, are you serious, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,亨利离开后你说过 我可以再回到台上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Henley left, you said I could get back on stage again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.78,0:14:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么就凭空冒出来个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not someone who just showed up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.28,0:14:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我考虑过 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you I'd think about it, and I have, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我真的需要你 再跟我一起在幕后多呆一会\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I really need you behind the scenes with me for a little while longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.49,0:14:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 好了 我这辈子都在幕后啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, come on. I've been behind the scenes my whole life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,补充一句 那可是犯罪 你看到那人的脸了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which is a crime, might I add. Have you seen that man's face?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.58,0:14:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常感谢你为团队加入了女性\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much as I appreciate the addition of some femininity to the group, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.46,0:14:44.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这已经比阿特拉斯所提供的条件 要好很多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}over and above what Atlas provides, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.80,0:14:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们在这里真正的问题是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the real issue is we've been in this…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.22,0:14:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的问题是我们已经排练几个月了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, the issue is that we have been rehearsing for months{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.63,0:14:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我们一无所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}for something… We don't even know what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.39,0:14:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你继续努力直到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're going to keep working until…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:55.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到我们融合得像一个人一样 我知道 我听你说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until we work as a single organism. I know, I've heard you say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.89,0:14:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 你这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}The thing is, when you say that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.14,0:14:59.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你指的是我们 而不包括你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think what you're referring to is us, not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.73,0:15:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我是直接从天眼那里得到命令的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, I'm getting my orders directly from the Eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.19,0:15:03.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？然后我把命令转达给你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? And then I give them to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.73,0:15:05.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是你不喜欢 你可以走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you don't like that, you're welcome to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.32,0:15:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我哪都不去 但我 只管自家事\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not going anywhere. But I'm… Mmm. I'm taking care of myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.11,0:15:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 我能简短的插一句吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, can I just weigh in here really quickly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:10.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我想我知道这里究竟怎么回事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I think I see what's going on here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.07,0:15:13.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是个了不起的 亲如一家的团体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are this amazing, tight-knit family unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.99,0:15:16.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 而我是新来的… - 说我们是什么都行 但我们不是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a new person… - We are anything but a family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.41,0:15:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我母亲 有一次还拿刀顶着我爸的脖子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, my mother literally knifed my father in the neck one time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.50,0:15:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以其实你们挺像我家人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you are actually a little bit like my family unit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.54,0:15:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真的？- 但是 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Literally? - But, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.88,0:15:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想那是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was an accident, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.88,0:15:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那这意味着我们真的 要做点什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So, does this mean we're actually going to do something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.18,0:15:35.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都听说过奥克塔和他们的 花花公子CEO 欧文·凯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've all heard of Octa and their playboy CEO, Owen Case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.68,0:15:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的搭档 沃尔特·马布里一年前去世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His partner, Walter Mabry, died about a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.31,0:15:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,想不想知道这一切会带来什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna know what all this has been leading to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.23,0:15:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克塔将发布下一代手机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Octa's hosting the launch of the next-gen cell phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:45.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要这些手机走上街头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once these phones hit the streets, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.23,0:15:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会把使用者的信息发给黑市\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll siphon their users' information to the black market.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.15,0:15:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着奥克塔将出卖用户隐私 来增加自己的利润\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meaning Octa's selling privacy to up their profit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以天眼决定揭露他们的阴谋\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the Eye has decided to expose them for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.91,0:15:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的目的就是突袭他们的发布会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our mission is to hijack the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.83,0:15:59.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,排练结束了 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rehearsal's over, guys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们一直等待的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what we've been waiting for.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.58,0:16:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,该着重出江湖了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now it's time to get to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.21,0:16:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎 奥克塔开发者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome, Octa insiders, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.51,0:16:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,博客作者 以及记者们\N{\fnArial\fs30}bloggers and journalists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.22,0:16:17.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常高兴能请到大家 参加我们的特别活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're delighted that you've joined us to participate in our special event.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.60,0:16:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天标志着社会网络 新旅程的开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today marks the beginning of a bright new journey in social networking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的最新产品 奥克塔8代…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our latest product, Octa 8…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.45,0:16:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,钥匙 手机 平板 放进盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keys, cell phones, iPads, in the bin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.23,0:16:28.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.19,0:16:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,在里面不能发短信 推特 录像 或是吃东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't have you texting, tweeting, recording, or eating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.74,0:16:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我们会替你保管好它的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, we will take very good care of it for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.62,0:16:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 这里有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, by the way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.24,0:16:39.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯先生亲自写的安保备忘录\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security memo from Case himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.99,0:16:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些客人很奇怪的 要按照他的指示做 是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Couple of surprise guests. Just follow his lead, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.54,0:16:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好 我正前往控制室\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all good. I'm heading to the control room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.54,0:16:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 谢谢 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Thanks, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.88,0:16:51.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿特拉斯 走 - 不 迪伦 我不能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Atlas, go. - No, Dylan, I can't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.59,0:16:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？出什么问题了？- 不 人太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? What's the problem? - No, there's too many people…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.20,0:16:56.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯 现在欧文进场了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlas, I got Owen landing now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.39,0:16:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 现在就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I'm going now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.89,0:16:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 停下 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop. - Oh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.89,0:17:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好了 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.48,0:17:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,帕斯卡 厨房需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pascal, we need you in the kitchen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.00,0:17:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 演讲的主题是自由好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the speech is about freedom, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.79,0:17:26.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们像在这推销的是自由\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're trying to sell here, is freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.50,0:17:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是哪里搞不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which part of that do you not understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.96,0:17:29.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的天啊 - 我知道 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know, I'm sorry. - For goodness sake!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.46,0:17:30.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯斯先生 呃 我是法律部的约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Case, John from legal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.70,0:17:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这需要你的签名才能发布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just need your signature for release.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.88,0:17:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,把事情办好然后告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just get it done and get it back to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.97,0:17:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 笑一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey there, buddy! Smile!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.64,0:17:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁？搞什么啊 - 我是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? What the hell? - Who am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.56,0:17:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天是照相日 朱莉没跟你说 今天要照相吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is picture day. Did Julie not tell you it's picture day?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.98,0:17:50.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 照相日？你说什么啊 - 这是全公司都要执行的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Picture day? What are you… - Company-wide policy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.82,0:17:52.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 我还有工作要做 - 我也有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look, I got a job to do. - I have a job to do, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.65,0:17:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on a second. What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.90,0:17:54.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要一些支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to need some backup here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.03,0:17:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你打电话给谁？- 嘿 那是我的证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you calling? - Hey! That's my ID.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.24,0:17:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,保安 我的名字是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Security, my name is…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.41,0:17:58.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 波·沃尔什 谢谢 - 嘿 我才是波·沃尔什\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bo Walsh, thank you. - Hey, I'm Bo Walsh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.95,0:18:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是这个人 他不是波·沃尔什\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this guy. He's not Bo Walsh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.41,0:18:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你冷静点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Calm down, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.49,0:18:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Hey, what's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.12,0:18:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙刚进来拿闪光灯闪我眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy just came and put a flashlight in my eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.70,0:18:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在做我的工作 这个人 检查下他的徽章\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm trying to do my job. This guy, check his badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.00,0:18:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个人是谁？- 我是波·沃尔什 他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is this guy? - I'm Bo Walsh, not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.71,0:18:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里写的是「埃文斯精神病医院」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says here, "Evans Mental Facility.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.79,0:18:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「D·斯图奇」 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mark D. Stooge." - Hold on a second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这辈子都没见过这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen this before in my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.38,0:18:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 沃尔什先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Mr. Walsh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.67,0:18:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 斯图奇先生 - 等等 他不是沃尔什先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, Mr. Stooge. - Hold on. He's not Mr. Walsh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.01,0:18:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 来吧 我们走 - 这里怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. Let's go. - What's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.88,0:18:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才是波·沃尔什 他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Bo Walsh, not him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.72,0:18:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你真的不能再相信这城市的任何人了 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, you cannot trust anybody in this city anymore, can you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.06,0:18:25.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我 我要打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off me! Look, I want to make a phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.89,0:18:27.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我要打给我的上司 - 嘿 怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I want to call my boss! - Hey, hey! What's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.85,0:18:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要打电话给我的上司 这个混蛋…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to call my boss, and this jackass…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.90,0:18:31.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 去打电话吧 先生 那是你的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Make your phone call. That's your right, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是我的权力\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's my right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.15,0:18:35.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么鬼 - 你疯了 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell? - You're crazy. Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.07,0:18:37.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是… 我的手机在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't my… Where's my phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.78,0:18:39.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的手机在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my phone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.57,0:18:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯 斯图奇离开大楼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlas, Stooge has left the building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.41,0:18:42.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.74,0:18:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们控制电路板了 我要离开后台\N{\fnArial\fs30}The circuit board is ours. I am leaving backstage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.04,0:18:50.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 有请欧文·凯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, Owen Case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.21,0:18:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 鲁拉 让这些男人们 看看你的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Lula, show these guys what you're made of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.72,0:19:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里交给我吧 克拉克说你可以休息了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take over from here. Clark says you're on break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.64,0:19:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么休息？克拉克是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}What break? Who's Clark?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.01,0:19:05.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,「克拉克是谁」 真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Who's Clark?" That's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.72,0:19:08.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我跟罗杰那么说 他会吓坏的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine if I told Roger that, he'd freak out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.14,0:19:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别那么做 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do that! - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.14,0:19:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗杰又是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who the hell is Roger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.56,0:19:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,莉莎知不知道你不认识罗杰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Lisa know that you don't know Roger?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.15,0:19:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道丽莎是谁 - 你又在开玩笑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know who Lisa is. - Are you kidding again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.52,0:19:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在又不认识丽莎了？- 不认识 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't know who Lisa is now? - No, I don't. Just get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.57,0:19:18.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那太危险了 - 你把肉都毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is a dangerous… - You're ruining the meat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.82,0:19:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,别逼我告诉布莱恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't make me have to go to Brian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.45,0:19:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不知道布莱恩是谁 - 你为什么这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't know who Brian is! - Why are you acting like this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.03,0:19:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我一会直接告诉他 - 给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll go straight to him. - Give me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.49,0:19:25.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.21,0:19:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.21,0:19:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 救命 - 去帮她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Help me! - Help her. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.71,0:19:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have some water.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.25,0:19:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,从你的表情我看出来你被血吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel from your face you're freaked by the flow of blood, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.05,0:19:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我手指一弹就没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is fully fixable in a snap{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.76,0:19:45.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要专心和依照我的话做\N{\fnArial\fs30}by focusing and following the flow of my words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:47.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,仿佛你在流动和飘浮\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you're flowing and floating, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.72,0:19:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你要专注于我的指令\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is why you're focusing on my commands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.73,0:19:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生活中到目前为止的成就\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this far in life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.19,0:19:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是靠听那一个声音 你脑中的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}by listening to one voice, the voice in your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这就是那个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is that voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.19,0:20:00.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,倾听你自己的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to your own voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.95,0:20:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.29,0:20:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 那是什么？是魔法毛巾吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow. What is that? Is that a miracle towel?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.21,0:20:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,太感谢了 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much. Do you know what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.96,0:20:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你教会了我 我不适合这种工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have taught me that I'm not cut out for this kind of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.47,0:20:23.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我辞职\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.18,0:20:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,在拿条毛巾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get another towel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.34,0:20:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, and goodbye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.39,0:20:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.70,0:20:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.81,0:20:36.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 万众期待的时刻到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, the moment that you've all been waiting for…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.94,0:20:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干得好 女士 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nice work, lady. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.98,0:20:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克塔2代的革命性音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Revolutionized music with Octa 2.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我有点紧张 这都还没上台呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm actually nervous, and I'm not even going onstage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.78,0:20:49.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听说如果你紧张\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I've heard that if you're nervous, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:53.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象对方的裸体会对你有帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can be really helpful to picture each other naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实是想象观众是裸体的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's actually picture the audience naked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.00,0:20:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 这是新招 新的科学\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is new. This is a new science.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.75,0:20:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.17,0:21:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要不要 我们该试试 - 现在没心情\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want… We should try it. - Not the right mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.42,0:21:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来只能靠我们了 老伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guess that leaves you and me, old buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.13,0:21:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 想象对方… 不 不 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Picture each other… No. No, thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.59,0:21:08.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 我承认脖子以上有些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I admit, from the neck up there are issues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.05,0:21:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的脖子以下 都还是大卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}But from the neck down, the David.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.22,0:21:13.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧文·凯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owen Case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.73,0:21:17.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 奥克塔精英们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Octa-lites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.15,0:21:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 奥克塔精英们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning, Octa-lites.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.19,0:21:21.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我宣布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I've made the claim…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.78,0:21:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 我宣布过奥克塔8代是绝对的魔法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I've made the claim that Octa 8 is pure magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.61,0:21:27.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,但事实是 那只是那种\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the truth is, that's just one of those things I say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.70,0:21:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说是真相 但其实\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the truth is, that's just one of those things I say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.20,0:21:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,另有含义的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when in fact I mean something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.54,0:21:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,但其实是另有含义的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}…when in fact I mean something else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.79,0:21:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我是指什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else do I mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.17,0:21:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 我将为你们展示 我美妙的谎言和伪善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, here to fill you in on some of my fabulous lies and hypocrisy, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.51,0:21:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,并表演一些你们从未见过的 最炫目的魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}and to perform some of the most dazzling feats of magic you have ever seen…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.55,0:21:52.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们是全世界 - 最伟大的魔术师\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They are the world's… - greatest magicians.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.22,0:21:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,来这里揭露我的骗术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here to expose me for the fraud I truly am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.06,0:21:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 有请四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, here are the Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.48,0:22:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,纽约 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, New York!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.12,0:22:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.08,0:22:18.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 能回来真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's great to be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.92,0:22:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,看我们最新的骑士 鲁拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And have you met our newest Horseman, Lula?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.42,0:22:29.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感觉很好 对吧 - 感觉太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Feels good, right? - Pretty good. Pretty good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.60,0:22:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, thank you. Um, okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.56,0:22:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们想聊聊你们的隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to talk to you about your privacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.39,0:22:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,隐私对你们来说有什么意义？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does your privacy mean to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:40.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显对欧文·凯斯来说 隐私毫无意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because apparently to Owen Case, it means absolutely nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.31,0:22:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 其实比没意义还更没意义\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, actually it means less than absolutely nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.86,0:22:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 他嘲弄你们的隐私 他蔑视隐私\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, he's mocked your privacy. He's scorned it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.99,0:22:48.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 而且我们说的不只是那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, and we're not just talking about the things that you already agreed to{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.07,0:22:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你看都不看就签下\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you signed, probably without reading{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.37,0:22:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥克塔客户条款第1-7条的协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}the terms and conditions of Octas 1 through 7.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.29,0:23:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 FBI来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, the FBI is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.21,0:23:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.59,0:23:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 改编成C-4计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, go to plan C-4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.88,0:23:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lock the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.80,0:23:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,老板 你来了真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, boss, I'm glad you're here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.47,0:23:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.43,0:23:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 听我说 我们得绕一下 从后面进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, look. We got to move around, get in through the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.14,0:23:16.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些骑士们很狡猾 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}These Horsemen are tricky, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的后备计划都有后备计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}They got backup plans on top of backup plans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.69,0:23:21.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 不是故意幸灾乐祸的 不过我跟你说过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, sorry, don't mean to gloat, but I told you so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.81,0:23:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别废话了 罗兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cut the bullshit, Rhodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.06,0:23:25.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一小时前我们接到匿名电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got an anonymous phone call an hour ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.32,0:23:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那确认了我一直以来跟她说的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirms everything I've been telling her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.07,0:23:28.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.15,0:23:29.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你派特工去底特律和费城\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sent agents to Detroit and Philadelphia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.57,0:23:31.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直在喊 狼来了这样我们就不会派他们来这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been crying wolf so we wouldn't send them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.91,0:23:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 老大 拜托 - 继续开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Boss, please. - Keep working on the doors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.62,0:23:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你跟我说 你没信考恩疯狂的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me that you haven't bought into Cowan's crazy, paranoid fantasia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.62,0:23:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,在节目开始之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before we start the show…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.29,0:23:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们让欧文同意了 我们提出的一些条款\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had Owen agree to a few terms and conditions of our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.08,0:23:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以所有我们曾经认为是隐私的东西…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, everything that he had once considered private…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.59,0:23:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他认为是真正隐私的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he thinks is really private…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.80,0:23:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有他认为是隐私的东西现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, everything that he once considered private is now…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.85,0:23:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.19,0:24:05.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像骑士们喜欢说的 魔术的关键是控制想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the Horsemen like to say, magic is about controlling perception.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.07,0:24:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们把他们看作真相的勇士 但他们是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see them as champions of the truth, but are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.19,0:24:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说这也是他们营造的幻觉之一？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or is that just another one of their illusions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.20,0:24:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事 罗兹 - 这简直疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's going on, Rhodes? - This is crazy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.82,0:24:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得让所有人到另一个入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to get everyone to the other exits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.37,0:24:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们走 到后面 - 不 你呆在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go, to the back. - No. You stay here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.04,0:24:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 既然他们这么喜爱秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, since they clearly love secrets…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.33,0:24:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就揭露一些他们的秘密好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's reveal some of theirs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.92,0:24:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹尼 各位 离开舞台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Danny, everyone, get off the stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.86,0:24:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,撤退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Abort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.84,0:24:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 跟他们一起走 我会在集合点跟你们碰面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, go with them. I'll see you at the meet-up point.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.59,0:24:32.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.67,0:24:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,记不记得杰克·怀尔德之死？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recall the death of Jack Wilder?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.89,0:24:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我跟你们说他其实没死 而且就在这儿会怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I told you he's not just alive, but he's actually right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.86,0:24:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道还有谁在这吗 FBI\N{\fnArial\fs30}And do you know who else is here? The FBI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.23,0:24:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们进来吧 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's let them in, shall we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.90,0:24:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 惊天秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, for the big reveal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.74,0:24:58.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 上舞台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go! To the stage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.49,0:25:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,有第五个骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a fifth Horseman, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.62,0:25:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而他是他们之中最大的罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's the biggest criminal of them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.50,0:25:06.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,FBI特工 迪伦·罗兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI agent, Dylan Rhodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.06,0:25:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就知道 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I knew it. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.88,0:25:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这水要比你知道深得多 老大\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so much deeper than you know, boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.59,0:25:14.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为自己看着一样东西 但你根本不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're looking at one thing, but you have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.84,0:25:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是谁 - 跟我一直以来一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are you? - The same man I've always been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.28,0:25:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计们 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.03,0:25:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是在耍我吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gotta be kidding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.65,0:25:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要去滑管 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We've gotta get to the chute. - Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.69,0:25:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些人是谁 - 管谁呢 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who are those guys? - Who cares? Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.53,0:25:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快 快 - 继续走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hurry, hurry! - Keep going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.78,0:25:36.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell could this happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.86,0:25:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为一切都在迪伦的掌控之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought Dylan had everything under control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.62,0:25:40.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 很明显他没掌控\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Apparently he didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.49,0:25:43.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是你泄露的 丹 你鬼鬼祟祟的干嘛去了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you're the leak, Dan. Where you been sneaking off to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.62,0:25:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然敢暗示我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you dare for a second insinuate that I had…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.21,0:25:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没在暗示 那是你 - 我们上车 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not insinuating. That's your… - Let's get to the truck, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.67,0:25:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一起走 - 走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stay together! - Move! Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.92,0:25:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁拉 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lula, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.05,0:25:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,来了 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming! Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.93,0:25:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 喔 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.60,0:26:06.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡 睡 睡 睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep. Sleep. Sleep. Sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.78,0:26:18.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.32,0:26:20.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么不是车子？- 我们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wasn't there supposed to be a truck? - Where the hell are we?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.87,0:26:24.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.20,0:26:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 你接错管子了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey! Wait, did you mis-run the tube?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.16,0:26:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 我接到车子里了 我知道我接好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I put it in the truck. I know I did!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.80,0:26:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们现在真的不是在车上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're really not in the truck right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.50,0:26:30.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定有人移动管子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody must have moved the tube.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.92,0:26:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在一间中国餐厅上方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were we above a Chinese restaurant? Give me that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.46,0:26:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在走 轻点 - 有地方出问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm moving! Relax! - There's something very wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.38,0:26:39.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我们为什么在这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Why are we here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.68,0:26:41.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么这么饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why am I frickin' starving?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.72,0:26:43.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也很饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm weirdly starving, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.93,0:26:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这没道理啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This makes no sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.17,0:27:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.79,0:27:15.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少 我知道虽然这没法安慰人\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least, and I know this isn't much consolation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.25,0:27:17.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过很明显现在我们被 中国菜包围了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but apparently we're now surrounded by Chinese food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.05,0:27:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对吧？- 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right? - Guys…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.38,0:27:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我们现在这地方 不能光用「中国菜」来形容\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think where we are right now, they don't refer to it as "Chinese food."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.05,0:27:26.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就叫做「菜」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just called "food."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.02,0:27:33.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你说什么？这怎么可能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, what are you saying? How is this possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.11,0:27:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信用你独特的说法 那个词应该是「魔术」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe in your particular parlance, the word is "magic."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.66,0:27:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙跟你长得一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy looks exactly like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.24,0:27:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你长得一模一样 你看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He looks exactly like you. Are you seeing this right now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.37,0:27:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.58,0:27:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这表情让我觉得就像听 别人说自己见到滚石乐队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must confess, it's like what I heard about meeting the Rolling Stones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.62,0:27:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现他们真人比相片矮一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a lot shorter in person.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.63,0:27:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,记不记得我跟你们说过有一个 我做什么他都捣乱的人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember I told you about the guy who screwed me out of everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.55,0:28:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我的双胞胎兄弟 沙斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my twin brother, Chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.01,0:28:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这是你干的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, did you do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.16,0:28:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,如你们所见 我的老板不喜欢乱来\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you can see, my boss don't mess around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.93,0:28:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全不明白现在这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not understand what is going on right now. At all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.69,0:28:13.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 让我替你们说明一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let me break it down for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.85,0:28:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们从纽约的一个屋顶跳下来 落到了澳门\N{\fnArial\fs30}You jumped off a rooftop in New York and you landed in Macau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.94,0:28:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,也叫中国的维加斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}AKA the Vegas of China.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:21.57,0:28:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,快速转移\N{\fnArial\fs30}And presto-changeo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.95,0:28:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you just love it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:25.20,0:28:27.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,「全世界最伟大的魔术师们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}The "greatest magicians in the world"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.37,0:28:29.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,居然成了别人魔术里面的道具\N{\fnArial\fs30}are the object of someone else's magic trick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.91,0:28:32.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这难道不是很诗意吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that poetic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.50,0:28:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不觉得？知道吗 我不会让你们倒我胃口的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? You know what, I'm not gonna let you guys yuck my yum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.84,0:28:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,咻咻 还是姆咻 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shoo-shoo. Or mu-shu. Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.63,0:28:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 还有知不知道他们说的「发生在澳门的」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, and you know what they say, "What happens in Macau…"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.43,0:28:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,下半句不记得了 因为是用中文说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, I don't know the rest of it, 'cause it's in Chinese, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.77,0:28:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thanks, guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:10.99,0:29:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,据报称臭名昭著的四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reports are coming in that the infamous Horsemen{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.50,0:29:15.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,操控了今天的奥克塔新品发布会\N{\fnArial\fs30}hijacked the Octa product launch today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.67,0:29:17.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们反而被摆了一道\N{\fnArial\fs30}The trick was on them, however, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.38,0:29:20.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也知道了杰克·怀尔德 奇迹般的复活\N{\fnArial\fs30}as we learned of the miraculous resurrection of Jack Wilder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.80,0:29:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及FBI特工迪伦·罗兹其实是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the stunning revelation that FBI Agent Dylan Rhodes{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.92,0:29:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,部门里内鬼这一惊人事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been working as a mole within the Bureau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.43,0:29:29.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今疑云密布 如今全球范围内已经展开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Questions abound today as an international manhunt is underway{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.89,0:29:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦·罗兹 以及他及其神出鬼没的魔术师犯罪集团\N{\fnArial\fs30}for Dylan Rhodes and his elusive and criminal band of illusionists.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.10,0:29:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 真的 你们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, seriously, where are you guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.44,0:29:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在接头点 还给你们留了言\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm at the meetup. I've been leaving you messages.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.36,0:29:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一点消息都没有 求你们打我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't heard from anyone. Please, call me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.78,0:29:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,周四股市\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the stock market{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.98,0:29:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在大涨后小回\N{\fnArial\fs30}saw big gains and modest losses on Thursday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.16,0:29:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 告诉我你很安全 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, tell me you're safe. Where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.82,0:29:53.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你18个月前丢下我的地方 罗兹特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right where you left me, 18 months ago, Agent Rhodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.25,0:29:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔迪乌斯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.50,0:29:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去一切的感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it feel to lose everything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.46,0:30:00.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的工作 你的身份 你活下去的理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your job. Your identity. Your reason for living.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.46,0:30:03.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,失去掌控的滋味如何？也许这是你第一次尝到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it feel to be out of control, perhaps for the first time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.09,0:30:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为谁工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.26,0:30:10.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个蠢货 罗兹特工 一直都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a fool, Agent Rhodes. You always have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.14,0:30:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们在哪？- 我不会在电话里告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are they? - I'm not telling you on the phone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.43,0:30:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪里？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.52,0:30:18.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想知道 四骑士最近遭遇的挫折 背后是不是我指使的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you're wondering if I was behind the Horsemen's recent debacle, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.60,0:30:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就交给你自己去调查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll let you work that out for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.44,0:30:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我烧死过你一次 我还会再烧一次的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I burned you once, I'll burn you again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.44,0:30:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在玩游戏 塔迪乌斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not playing, Thaddeus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.79,0:30:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我的游戏 罗兹特工 是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not my game, Agent Rhodes. It's yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.28,0:30:28.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你把我锁进牢房时 你就开始了游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}You started it when you locked me in a cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.82,0:30:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一局只是轮到我走而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is simply my move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.62,0:30:32.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一步该你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next one is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.91,0:30:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.08,0:30:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.46,0:30:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 救命 爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad! Help me! Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.09,0:30:46.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.11,0:31:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,关键在于盲点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all about blind spots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.11,0:31:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你直接盯着一样东西 却看不到它 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you're staring straight at something, and not see it. Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.70,0:31:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,盲点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blind spots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.49,0:31:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们一起学到的 不是吗兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}We learned that together, didn't we, bro?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.79,0:31:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有没有跟你们说过 我们曾经是搭档？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he tell you that we were partners once?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.71,0:31:21.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有？不会没说过吧 著名的「小麦金尼兄弟」\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? I didn't think so. The "Mini-McKinneys."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.96,0:31:24.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,切西和梅比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chasey and a Mer-Bear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.38,0:31:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,会让你吓死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gonna make you scare-bear{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.46,0:31:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,魔法麦金尼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma-ma-magic McKinneys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.64,0:31:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.97,0:31:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后一天 我们12岁 弗吉尼亚·冯·威尔谢姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then, one day, we were 12 and Virginia von Welsheim{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.64,0:31:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,在街头举行了一个很棒的派对\N{\fnArial\fs30}had a very nice party down the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.60,0:31:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点情况不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a little tum-tum, couldn't go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.98,0:31:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅比自己去了 尝到了独自表演的甜头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mer-Bear did it on his own, and got a taste of the solo thing, and uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.45,0:31:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后就把我一脚踢开 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- …and kicked me to the curb. - Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.28,0:31:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙斯 你赢了 我承认 你是怎么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase, you win! I concede. Just tell me how you did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.83,0:32:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,快递员 一个月前来到你家 小萨？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delivery guy came to your door about a month ago, little za.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.17,0:32:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Za?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.60,0:32:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,披萨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pizza, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.26,0:32:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是D3375公寓吗 - 完全不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is this apartment D3375? - Not even close.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.76,0:32:19.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.43,0:32:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 漂浮 飘荡 入梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relaxing, floating, drifting, dreaming…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.00,0:32:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,坠落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Falling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.02,0:32:27.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我的小兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what he did, my little womb-mate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.69,0:32:31.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,下载了你所有的私人信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}is he downloaded all your private information, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.70,0:32:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的老板有了他需要的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my employer had all he needed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.95,0:32:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.41,0:32:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道怎么找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know how to find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.29,0:32:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是个好问题 阿特拉斯 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's a very good question, Atlas. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.76,0:33:03.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着警卫 他们会带你去见我的老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just follow the guards. They'll take you to my boss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.94,0:33:10.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你玩猫捉老鼠很有意思 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been fun playing this cat-and-mouse with you, broski.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.78,0:33:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,喵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Meow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.28,0:33:16.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,玩的开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have fun at the Sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.45,0:33:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真是非常 非常对不起 - 对 你应当道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I am so, so, so sorry. - Yeah, you should be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.46,0:33:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说我背叛我们了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't ever accuse me of betraying us again, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.05,0:33:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们有没有想过天眼正在看着这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you guys ever think that the Eye is watching this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.85,0:33:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许这就是他们想要的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, that maybe this is even what they want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.44,0:33:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,在某个瞬间\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at the exact right moment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.10,0:33:50.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会突然出现 然后我们会…\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're gonna swoop in, and we'll be like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.44,0:33:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,「太好了 谢天谢地你来了」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Yes! Thank God you're here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.36,0:33:54.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,「谢天谢地 来的刚刚好 天眼」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank God! Just in the nick of time, Eye!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.90,0:33:58.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们会庆祝 到最后一切都是值得的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we'll just celebrate, and it was all worth it in the end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.12,0:34:05.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实我也不是那么想的 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even really think that, either, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.25,0:34:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.51,0:34:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.56,0:34:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗒嗒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.18,0:34:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你们合作我太开心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So happy to be working with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.52,0:34:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,请进 请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, come in. Come in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.06,0:34:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 喔 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.27,0:34:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你是怎么跟我们合作的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, sorry, how are you working with us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.69,0:34:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,就跟魔术师从帽子里拽出兔子一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, well, as much as a magician who pulls a rabbit from a hat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.70,0:34:39.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,要跟那兔子合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}is working with that rabbit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.61,0:34:43.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会合作的 没错 我想介绍一下自己…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll be working together. Yes. Allow me to introduce myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.24,0:34:45.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你是沃尔特·马布里 你一年前死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you're Walter Mabry. You died a year ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.83,0:34:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我这点子是学你的 怀尔德先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. An idea I got from you, Mr. Wilder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.79,0:34:49.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,伪装自己的死 然后世界就会放下防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fake your death, the world puts its guard down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.79,0:34:51.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我控制了那么几家公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm able to control quite a few companies, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.88,0:34:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,包括我老搭档欧文的\N{\fnArial\fs30}including my old partner, Owen's, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.46,0:34:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,用的是所谓的匿名持股者组成的财团\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a consortium of so-called anonymous shareholders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.67,0:35:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那违反了多少条证监会法律？- 应该是每一条都违反了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And that violates how many SEC laws? - I believe it breaks all of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.47,0:35:01.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,每一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.93,0:35:04.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 你们都想要观众\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, you all want an audience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.89,0:35:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,迫切的需要一个观众 这真的很让人难过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need one, desperately. It's quite sad, really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.39,0:35:10.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是 我虽然有能力抓住你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hence, my ability to nab you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.56,0:35:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但另一方面 我想要的正好完全相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}I, on the other hand, want the opposite of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.44,0:35:17.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想 而且现在正是百分百的在体制之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to be, and I am 100 percent off the grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.90,0:35:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道为什么吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.28,0:35:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 因为体制是为真正的人准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, because the grid is for actual human beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.87,0:35:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 因为在一个大数据的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, because in a world of total surveillance, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.28,0:35:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一真正的自由只存在于不被看见之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only true freedom lies in not being seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.50,0:35:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能从体制内控制体制\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't control the grid from within the grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.83,0:35:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow me. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.79,0:35:33.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 跟我来 - 好了好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Follow me. - Okay. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.67,0:35:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从兔子身上拽出了一顶帽子 那真是让人眼前一亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You pulled a hat out of a rabbit. That was very colorful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.05,0:35:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是大概8年半之前了 所以 不用特意提起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost eight and a half years ago. So, no need to bring that up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.63,0:35:42.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟我们不能为青春时期犯下的 所有错误都买单\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't all be held accountable for our adolescent personas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.34,0:35:44.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 大魔术师？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we, Magicolio?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.55,0:35:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那都是15年前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Magicolio, that was 15 years ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.97,0:35:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别误会了 我喜欢那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong, I love magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.93,0:35:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你和很多其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like you, and many others who, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.19,0:35:53.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,一样高中没有过性经历 虽然尝试过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose, were not getting any sex in high school, I dabbled with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.31,0:35:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不像你们 我能够力求转变追求真正的魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh, unlike you, I was able to transition upward towards actual magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.78,0:36:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,科学 你们可能都听说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science, you may have heard it called.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.45,0:36:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 朋友们 想不想知道 我是怎么把你们弄到这的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, would you like to know, my friends, just how I got you here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.87,0:36:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道你是怎么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know how you did it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.29,0:36:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.37,0:36:13.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你偷了我们节目的文件 然后很明显把我们催眠了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you stole our files for the show, then obviously hypnotized us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.17,0:36:14.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的 别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop. No. Seriously, stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.67,0:36:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,管道里有连续的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}The strobe was a combo of binaural beats, as well as…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.09,0:36:19.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:19.51,0:36:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可能不觉得有趣 但我觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might not be having fun, but I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.80,0:36:25.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这表现方式真独特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have an unusual way of showing it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.89,0:36:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:27.68,0:36:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did I do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.60,0:36:34.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,简单 你看魔术师喜欢 控制别人的视角\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. You see, magicians like to control other people's perceptions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:34.23,0:36:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在激动紧张之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}In your heightened state of agitation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.61,0:36:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了最简单的方法 楼顶 黑色管道\N{\fnArial\fs30}you saw the simplest cues. Black tube, roof.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.02,0:36:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一心想着跳下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And your minds filled in the rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.53,0:36:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你们原本应该跳进去的那根管子 就在你们右侧20英尺\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the tube you meant to go down was 20 feet to your right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.45,0:36:45.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 坐下 坐下 不用一直站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on, sit down. There's no one standing in your way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.53,0:36:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不介意站着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't mind if I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.87,0:36:51.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 你们进入管道之后 没错 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, once in the tube, yes, you're right…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.12,0:36:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,巴拉巴拉 管道里含有螺旋形灯管以及词语「睡吧」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blah, blah, blah, the strobe contained UV letters pulsing the word "sleep".{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.00,0:37:00.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯光加上声音让你们 很快进入了催眠模式\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that, combined with the sound, put you into an instant alpha pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.88,0:37:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,睡吧 睡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sleep, sleep, sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.76,0:37:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之后才是真正有趣的部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}And from then on, it really was just fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.51,0:37:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以向你们保证 你们不知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can assure you, you don't know what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.60,0:37:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真吓人 非常非常吓人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's really creepy. Really, really creepy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.27,0:37:20.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不酷\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not cool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:20.78,0:37:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 很简单 魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yep, easy stuff, magic, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.65,0:37:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你用心\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you put your mind to it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.11,0:37:27.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 够了 那为什么带我们来这\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, that's enough. So why are we here, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.16,0:37:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了让我们看到你有多聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides you getting to show off how adorably clever you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.95,0:37:32.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,就从去年你们盗窃的那个人开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, to start with, the man you stole from last year, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.83,0:37:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发现我在 他的一些公司里投了不少钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}turns out I had invested quite a lot of money in some of his companies, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.67,0:37:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们偷的钱中很大一部分 其实是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}so a lot of what you stole was, in fact, mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.96,0:37:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是 你们回报我的方式很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news is, it's very easy for you to pay me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.80,0:37:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需要你们的技术\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just need your skills.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.59,0:37:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,欧文和我就像甲壳虫乐队 如果甲壳虫曾经是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Owen and I were like the Beatles, if the Beatles had been…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.55,0:37:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾尔芬？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elfin?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.68,0:37:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}…geniuses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.10,0:37:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,甲壳虫乐队当然是天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty sure the Beatles were geniuses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.81,0:37:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像他们一样 我们有过梦想\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like them, we had a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.98,0:37:58.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能不能创造真正的 原声的魔法？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could we create actual, genuine magic?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.77,0:38:02.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你们之中有一人实现了 那个梦想 而那不是你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm guessing one of you achieved that dream, and it wasn't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.23,0:38:05.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那只是他希望你这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what he would like you to think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.45,0:38:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的梦想是优雅和技术的完美结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}My vision was a perfect blend of elegance and technology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.62,0:38:12.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但欧文希望独吞成果 所以他羞辱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Owen wanted it for himself so he humiliated me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.04,0:38:16.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的私人文件透露给了董事会\N{\fnArial\fs30}by exposing my private files to the board of directors{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.29,0:38:17.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,说服了他们相信我不稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}and convinced them that I am unstable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.79,0:38:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他睡着的时候你有没有给他拍照？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you take a picture of him while he was sleeping?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.04,0:38:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把我踢出了我自己的公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had me kicked out of my own company, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.46,0:38:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后独占了一块芯片的设计\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now he goes around taking credit for a chip{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.92,0:38:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不只是一台计算机的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's not just the key to one computer, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.76,0:38:28.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且能控制地球上所有的计算机系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}but every computer system on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.84,0:38:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能解码一切 破解防火墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can un-encrypt anything, crack the defense firewall, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.01,0:38:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,操纵市场 监控任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}manipulate markets, and spy on anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.85,0:38:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在它已经被卖给出价更高的买家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now it's being sold to the highest bidder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.68,0:38:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你这么有钱为什么不直接去买\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're so rich, why don't you just buy it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.39,0:38:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后让他得到钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he gets the money?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.90,0:38:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有成功的快乐？不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the pleasure? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.15,0:38:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,况且如果能让你们为我偷过来 为什么还要去买呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no. Besides, why would I buy it when I could have you steal it for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.74,0:38:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,它将在明天被展示给一些意向买家\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's being previewed tomorrow to the various suitors, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.74,0:38:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中包括你们的目标 一个南非黑帮带领的团队\N{\fnArial\fs30}which will include your targets, a crew lead by a South African gangster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.49,0:38:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,南非黑帮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}South African gangster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.04,0:38:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 怎么绕过安保是你们的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. How your team gets past security, that's up to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.83,0:38:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,但只要进去了你们只要 查看并偷走芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}But once you do, you just need to inspect it and steal it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.17,0:39:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.25,0:39:02.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 这最适合你们了不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this is perfect for you, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.13,0:39:03.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是魔术师和窃贼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're magicians and thieves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.29,0:39:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么会认为我们会 考虑这件工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think we would even consider doing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.96,0:39:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我有个理由 是什么来着？噢 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, oh, wait, I had a reason. What was it? Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.38,0:39:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 在老家你们是通缉犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, back home, you're wanted criminals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.05,0:39:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在这里我控制警察 赌场 媒体\N{\fnArial\fs30}But here, I control the police, the casinos, the media.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.39,0:39:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你们全新的生活 不再躲躲藏藏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can give you a new life, out of hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.48,0:39:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不接受 我会杀了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if you don't, I'll have you killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.11,0:39:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 我不会为你偷任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm not stealing a thing for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.82,0:39:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 除非迪伦告诉我可以干 - 真的？那迪伦到底在哪呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not unless Dylan tells me it's okay. - Really? Dylan is where, exactly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.99,0:39:32.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我同意他说的 所以你可以杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter. Yeah, I'm with him. So you can go ahead and kill us{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.95,0:39:34.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我也不会为你偷任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I'm not gonna steal anything for you either.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.03,0:39:38.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我们达成一致了 沃尔特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Strikes me that a consensus seems to be forming, Walter, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:38.71,0:39:40.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为你在虚张声势\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we're calling your bluff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.96,0:39:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 实际上 我们干 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Actually, we'll do it. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.09,0:39:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在澳门 全世界最古老的 魔术商店就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in Macau. The oldest magic store in the world is here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.92,0:39:50.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们能拿到需要的东西 然后就干\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll get the supplies we need, and we'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:50.93,0:39:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.89,0:39:54.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会很有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It should be fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.43,0:39:57.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙斯早上 会带你们去商店\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase will take you to the magic shop in the morning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:02.75,0:40:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,警徽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Badge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.28,0:40:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.57,0:40:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.03,0:40:16.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,考恩特工 你的证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Cowan. Your ID.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.58,0:40:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢对 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.08,0:40:24.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来布拉德利先生还在吃晚饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears Mr. Bradley's still at dinner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.63,0:40:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？跟他说休息结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Tell him recess is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.26,0:40:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.45,0:40:55.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这一步我走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so I made my move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.87,0:40:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪 我没时间废话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they? I don't have time for bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.12,0:41:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,多亏了你我有的是时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I have all the time in the world, thanks to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.70,0:41:04.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还没吃完我的龙虾 这让我很不爽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I didn't get to finish my lobster, which makes me very grumpy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.21,0:41:06.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧别废话了 你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, let's cut the crap. What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.04,0:41:10.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以先从别装得这么强硬开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can dispense with the tough guy act to begin with.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.30,0:41:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太想装得像了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too desperate for it to be believable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.97,0:41:17.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说了 你想要什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, what do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.64,0:41:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你用了搜查令里的219表格 来搜查我的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used a form 219 warrant to search my room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.31,0:41:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到了我和四骑士之间的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found a connection between me and the Four Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.06,0:41:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这意味着 你可以带我离开这里24小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means you can take me out of here on a 24-hour leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.27,0:41:33.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你要我帮你越狱？- 我要你带我出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want me to break you out? - I want you to take me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.57,0:41:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的就是引渡令\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you need is an extradition order, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.20,0:41:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以在我的印刷机上找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you'll find in that tray by my printer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.78,0:41:45.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 我和四骑士的消失 没有任何关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, I had nothing to do with the Horsemen's disappearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.25,0:41:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被引诱进入一个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were lured into a trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.79,0:41:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像桃乐西到达奥兹国时那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like Dorothy did when she landed in Oz, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.92,0:41:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开始意识到 离开的唯一方式 就是传过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're beginning to realize that the only way out is through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.22,0:42:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,而只有我可以帮你过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm the only one who can get you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.14,0:42:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你装了窃听器\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got this place wired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:02.60,0:42:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不需要我帮忙你都可以离开 这都是为了偿还\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't need me to get out of here. This is all about payback.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.81,0:42:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我相信以眼还眼 - 所以你是要出去毁掉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I believe in an eye for an eye. - So you're out to destroy me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.69,0:42:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, absolutely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.94,0:42:13.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我还会玩你的小游戏吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think I'm still gonna play your little game?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.28,0:42:14.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.03,0:42:19.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为不管你多努力的尝试 这一切幕后的罪犯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because no matter how hard you try to find a culprit behind all this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.12,0:42:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都只会怪罪自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're going to blame only yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.58,0:42:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在18个月前将我投进监狱 结束了你的小小复仇之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}When your little vendetta ended with you putting me in jail 18 months ago, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.12,0:42:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你累了 放松了 你不再注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}you got tired, you got sloppy. You stopped paying attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.09,0:42:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你失败的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's where you lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.30,0:42:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你可以救你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you can save yourself, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.55,0:42:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者跟我做个交易 救出四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}or you can make a deal with me, and save the Four Horsemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.10,0:42:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再浪费我们俩的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}and stop wasting both of our time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.56,0:42:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,为这个自恋狂小个子偷一样东西？我不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Steal something for this narcissistic little man boy? I don't like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.07,0:42:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我更不喜欢你替我们做决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I like less is you deciding for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.28,0:43:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？那你喜欢让我们沦为 魔术界的笑柄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Do you like that we're the laughing stocks of the magic world, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:00.91,0:43:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及现实世界的难民？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the fugitives of the actual world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.83,0:43:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特说得对 我们无处可去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter is right. We have nowhere to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.62,0:43:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们可以改变这点\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we can fix that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.95,0:43:07.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以改变这？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We can fix it? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.25,0:43:08.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在正式成为团队成员了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're officially part of the team now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.83,0:43:10.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说什么？- 迪伦说我们应该像\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - I'm sure this is what Dylan{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.71,0:43:12.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个有机体一样肯定就是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}meant when he said we should all work as a single organism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.88,0:43:16.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 那就是迪伦告诉他自己 还有我们的童话故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that is a fairytale that Dylan tells himself, and tells us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.21,0:43:18.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 就算我们拿到那东西 他也绝不会放我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, even if we get this stick, he'll never let us go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.93,0:43:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能相信沃尔特 好吗 天眼在澳门有过一段历史\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't trust Walter, okay? The Eye has a history in Macau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.10,0:43:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只能相信他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're the only ones we can trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.51,0:43:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果能联系上他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if we can get it to them, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.60,0:43:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就能洗刷我们的名誉 然后让我们离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}they can clear our names and get us the hell out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.98,0:43:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个馊主意 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a bad plan, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.40,0:43:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:39.15,0:43:40.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, how are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.53,0:43:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要一些定制的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, we need some things custom-made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.57,0:43:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上明天就要 我们有点赶时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, by tomorrow. We're kind of in a rush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.24,0:43:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:45.99,0:43:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道我在说什么对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what I'm talking about, do you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.17,0:43:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到翁氏商店 我叫李 不是李小龙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to long's. My name's Li. Not Bruce Lee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.51,0:43:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 吓到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.84,0:43:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吧 - 看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. - Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:01.93,0:44:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,跑去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:05.56,0:44:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 现在在我头上了 真有意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! And now it's by my head. How fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.43,0:44:08.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 20美元 - 20美元？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- $20. - $20?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:09.06,0:44:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不了 谢谢 我们有点赶时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thank you. We're kind of in a rush.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:11.02,0:44:13.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 10美元 - 呃 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- $10. - Uh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.36,0:44:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 买1送1 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Two for one. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.73,0:44:16.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 给我们大拇指就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right. Just give us the thumbs. Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.36,0:44:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 多谢 杰克 请拿着这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Thanks a lot, Jack. Please take these.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.69,0:44:21.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要藏牌器\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, we need a Keplinger holdout, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.40,0:44:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还需要止滑剂 隐形指腹 假袖 轨道\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we also need roughing fluid, a Sanada gimmick, sleeves, tracks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.49,0:44:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过都要塑料的 如果可以的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all in plastic, though, if you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.17,0:44:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.25,0:44:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.84,0:44:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我奶奶想知道为什么是塑料的 塑料的都是便宜货\N{\fnArial\fs30}My grandmother wants to know why plastic? Plastic is cheap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.09,0:44:42.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我们需要塑料的因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Yeah, we need plastic because we're…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.43,0:44:46.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要通过非常敏感的金属探测器\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going through a very sensitive metal detector, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.10,0:44:48.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 塑料 没事 金属…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So plastic, nothing. Metal…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.93,0:44:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,能探测到\N{\fnArial\fs30}It detects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.48,0:44:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did she say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:58.61,0:45:01.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说就算你说得很慢 还手脚比划\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said just because you're talking slowly and moving your hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.03,0:45:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也不能突然就听得懂英语\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't mean she can suddenly understand English.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.51,0:45:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 对 真对不起 他是种族主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. So sorry. He's racist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.95,0:45:11.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我知道唯一我们有共识的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, bro. Listen, I know that the only thing that we agree on{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.25,0:45:13.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我们的父母生的孩子太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}is that our mom and dad had one too many children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.92,0:45:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以为什么不让就孩子们玩他们的玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why don't we just let the kids play with their toys{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.30,0:45:19.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去喝一杯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go get a little drinkey-poo?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.84,0:45:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果免费的话 没问题 - 太好了 伙计们 我们马上回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If it's free, it's me. - Great. Guys, we'll be right back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.26,0:45:28.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 孩子们 监护人在看着你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, kiddies, the chaperones are watching you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.97,0:45:31.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,别做会让我不高兴的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do anything I wouldn't enjoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.31,0:45:34.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 你们俩玩的开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Have fun, you two.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.73,0:45:40.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 能借电话用吗？有件事挺重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Can I use your phone? It's kind of important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:40.23,0:45:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.44,0:45:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 免费的 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On the house. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.74,0:45:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你打电话给谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you calling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.91,0:45:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要安排转移芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm arranging to hand over the stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:48.45,0:45:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就是这么联系天眼的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's how we've been contacting the Eye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.29,0:45:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一直自己联系？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been doing it on your own?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.62,0:45:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:52.83,0:45:55.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 迪伦不会喜欢这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God. Dylan's not gonna like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.33,0:45:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是很关心迪伦喜欢怎么样 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not really concerned with what Dylan likes. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.46,0:45:58.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是为了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing this for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.88,0:46:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这东西怎么回事 - 嘿 轻点 这只是孩子的玩具\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is wrong with this thing? - Hey, relax, it's just a kid's toy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.72,0:46:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我也是这么想的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's what I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.13,0:46:07.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好 让我来 - 噢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. Let me just… - Ow!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.55,0:46:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sorry. Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.97,0:46:14.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 能开这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can you get this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.98,0:46:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直就像重生\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like birth, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.02,0:46:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个人进入医院 两个人出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}One person enters the hospital, two people come out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.57,0:46:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,边走边说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walk and talk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.07,0:46:28.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在飞机上告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you on the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.49,0:46:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}What plane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.66,0:46:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的线人告诉我你的骑士们在澳门\N{\fnArial\fs30}My sources tell me your Horsemen are in Macau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.41,0:46:36.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这表情怎么回事 - 不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's the look? - It's none of your business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.75,0:46:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的线人是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are your sources?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.63,0:46:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是些老朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just some old friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:49.55,0:46:52.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,等拿到卡我去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we have the card, where do I go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.64,0:46:54.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,0比52\N{\fnArial\fs30}And O for 52.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:55.10,0:46:58.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,完美 完美的比分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's perfect. It's a perfect score.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.23,0:47:02.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,那女孩们呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what about girls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.15,0:47:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,感情史？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, relationships?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.07,0:47:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.07,0:47:12.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 这不是我引以为傲的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it's not something I'm proud of, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.70,0:47:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,但每个我亲近的女孩 最后我都辜负了她们的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}but every girl I get close to, I end up taking their trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:18.83,0:47:21.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,还掏空了她们的钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then their wallet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.92,0:47:23.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:25.51,0:47:28.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你拿她们的钱包？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You take their wallets? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.26,0:47:32.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,还拿她们的皮带吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ever take their belts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.85,0:47:38.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者 酒店吧台的花生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or how about some peanuts from the hotel bar?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.35,0:47:41.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道你拿那些干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure why you took those.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.40,0:47:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你是不是以为我也跟 其他女孩一样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, did you think that I was like those other girls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.03,0:47:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.58,0:47:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 街尾有个市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So there's a marketplace down the street.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.83,0:47:57.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要见一个戴蓝帽子的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm meeting a man with a blue hat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.04,0:48:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会找到合适的人带我们回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll get the stick to the right people and get us home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.83,0:48:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去叫上梅里特好吗？我们有很多事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go grab Merritt, okay? We got a lot to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.96,0:48:04.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 嘿 系上腰带\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, hey, put your belt on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.75,0:48:07.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 不是那样的 她从我身上解下来的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no, it's not… She took it off me and…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.67,0:48:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我这辈子最伤心的时刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the most heartbreaking moment of my life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.59,0:48:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是当我发现 你偷走了我所有的钱然后分了\N{\fnArial\fs30}was when I discovered that you had stolen all my money and split.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.39,0:48:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道现在才发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize until now{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.56,0:48:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时拿了多大一笔钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}how much of that money you put into your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.10,0:48:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 鼻子下面的毛 比头顶的还多不觉得奇怪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, is it weird to have more hair in your nose than on your head?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.77,0:48:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,说起来 下次你植发的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Speaking of, next time you get a hair transplant, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.40,0:48:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该考虑下别的产品 而不是老头子的鸟毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}you might wanna consider requesting something other than old man pubes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.12,0:48:38.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是个小丑 小梅\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? You are such a buffoon, Mer-Bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.24,0:48:40.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你自己拖住我 让你朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this little ploy you have{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.25,0:48:44.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,在背后搞我老板的这套小把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}of stalling me while your friends screw over my employer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.42,0:48:46.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,是行不通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not gonna work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:48.42,0:48:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,沙斯 当你直视我的双眼 你会发现自己想睡觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase! As you stare into my eyes, you will find that you wanna sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.72,0:48:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你醒来 你会祈求梅里特的原谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you wake, you will beg for Merritt's forgiveness{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.43,0:48:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,并弄明白自己永远比不上他的一半好\N{\fnArial\fs30}and realize that you will never be half the man that he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.64,0:49:07.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅里特 真的非常非常对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merritt, I am so, so very, very sorry{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.40,0:49:10.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的这个学生真是太可悲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}about how pathetic your pupil is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.19,0:49:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 给你一个关于惊喜的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, a little hint on your technique of surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.45,0:49:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的惊喜根本就没有一点 惊喜所需要的元素\N{\fnArial\fs30}It lacks that all-essential little element of surprise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:18.28,0:49:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 这很有意思 小梅 下次有空再试试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, this has been fun, Mer-Bear. Let's do it again sometime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.08,0:49:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我有足够的时间做一些研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I've had ample time to do some research, and you know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.09,0:49:32.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我似乎错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.22,0:49:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为 天眼也许是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the Eye might actually be real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.89,0:49:37.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还以为你不信那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you didn't buy into all that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.43,0:49:39.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是我说我不认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd be lying if I said I didn't think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:39.51,0:49:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条路能指引我找到幕后的 伟大魔术师\N{\fnArial\fs30}that this road would lead to the great wizard behind the curtain{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.93,0:49:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,并最终见到他的脸 那我肯定在撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, in the end, I might get to see his face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.56,0:49:46.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That ain't gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:46.86,0:49:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使四骑士的性命都寄托于此？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if the fate of the Horsemen depends on it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.48,0:49:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我说 我把你带出来了 我们现在不会改变协议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me. I broke you out of there. We're not changing the terms now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.23,0:49:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是你把我弄进去的 - 对 因为你活该呆在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You put me there! - Yeah, because you deserve to be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.03,0:49:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 听着 我没杀你父亲 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Listen, I did not kill your father. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.66,0:50:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧 就别废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, let's just cut the bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:00.66,0:50:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你是谁 施莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know who you are, Shrike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.58,0:50:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你把你爸爸的死怪在我身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you blame me for your father's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.79,0:50:08.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:08.90,0:50:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我刺激他 让他冲动尝试危险戏法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I goaded him into performing a trick he couldn't pull off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.88,0:50:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道进监狱是30年报复计划的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the time in jail was a result of a 30-year revenge plot against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.63,0:50:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算那些都是针对 你觉得我会现在告诉你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Supposing that's all true, you think I'd tell you now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.93,0:50:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.85,0:50:23.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,30年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.56,0:50:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,创造了史上最伟大的长时间魔术技法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty years, and the greatest long game magic trick ever created.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:29.23,0:50:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,就为了把我关进监狱 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just to put me behind bars. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.61,0:50:36.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到我进去感觉如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how did it feel, seeing me there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.53,0:50:39.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那一切就是你所希望的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was it all you hoped?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.37,0:50:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what you're talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.87,0:50:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在撒谎 那是空虚的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying. It was an empty experience.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.04,0:50:47.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道我怎么知道的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you wanna know how I know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.17,0:50:50.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道因为你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know because you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.21,0:50:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,永远 永远都是 不只是表面的这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always, always more than what's on the surface.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.88,0:50:59.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那又怎么样 过去的事情没有发生 你也不是我想象的那样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what, the past didn't happen, and you're not who I think you are?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.34,0:51:00.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别跟我说30年里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, don't tell me in 3O years{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.55,0:51:03.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你第一次问自己那个问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's the first time you've asked yourself that question.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.06,0:51:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是我爸爸 你没法影响我 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not my father. You're not getting in my head, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.48,0:51:09.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为能把我引入陷阱？你不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're luring me into a trap? You're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.06,0:51:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我是很急 这意味着我很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I am desperate, which means I'm dangerous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.77,0:51:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我唯一担心的就是四骑士的安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}My only concern is the health and well-being of the Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.32,0:51:19.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要带我找到他们 如果你不带 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna lead me to them. And if you don't, I promise you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:19.86,0:51:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的下场绝对比 轻松的躺在牢房里要悲惨的多\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna end up far worse than in some cushy jail cell somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.17,0:51:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是四骑士其实不需要你拯救呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if the Horsemen don't actually need you to save them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.31,0:51:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 实验室是由两个分离的隔断组成\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So the lab is made up of two distinct layers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.18,0:51:51.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,安保外围以及无菌室\N{\fnArial\fs30}the security perimeter and the clean room.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:51.31,0:51:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找的芯片应该在这个中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stick we're looking for should be in this core.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:53.40,0:51:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要到那下面 拿到芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're gonna have to get underneath, extract it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.52,0:51:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后用个仿制品替换掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}and replace it with a decoy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.32,0:51:58.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在回到芯片上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, we're about to get to the chip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:58.74,0:52:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,这芯片很轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the thing about the chip, it's very thin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.40,0:52:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸运的是跟扑克牌大小重量差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Luckily, it's similar in weight and size to a playing card, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.37,0:52:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们要把飞牌技术再精进一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we're gonna have to brush up on our card-istry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.33,0:52:08.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,喔 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:12.79,0:52:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's no good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.47,0:52:25.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们要怎么进去？哈尼斯·派克\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we get in? Hannes Pike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.76,0:52:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是南非黑帮的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's the son of a South African gangster.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.64,0:52:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟着他来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's RSVP'd with what looks like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.39,0:52:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有保镖和随从\N{\fnArial\fs30}a couple of members of his security detail.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.44,0:52:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有个博士 负责检查 我猜的 还有个叫巴菲的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}A doctor, to vet it, I guess, and somebody named Buffy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:34.52,0:52:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 而且他每周旅行都会换女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, apparently, he travels with a different bimbo every week. Hmm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.28,0:52:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道我们谁来演那个女人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wonder which one of us gets to play the bimbo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.50,0:52:51.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我能加入吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can I get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.08,0:52:54.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在老虎机柔和的声音中\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the soothing sound of the slots{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.71,0:52:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进入平静的状态昏昏欲睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}you slip into a serene state of slumber and sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.59,0:53:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 一段时间里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, for a moment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.22,0:53:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会认为你是汗内斯 拖住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}they will think you're Hannes, so lead them out and keep them busy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:04.01,0:53:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他对你们无条件的信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}You trust your people implicitly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.26,0:53:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会让他们处理一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will have them take care of everything, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.39,0:53:09.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在车上等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will wait in the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.89,0:53:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,睁开眼睛 醒过来 去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And eyes open, wide awake. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.52,0:53:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,不好意思 这些人在跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. These people are following me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.40,0:53:16.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也许该检查一下他们的口袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna check their pockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.73,0:53:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们有很短的时间进入实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then our time is ticking to infiltrate the lab{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.11,0:53:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把芯片偷出来拿到市场上 我会交给天眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and get the card to the market, where I'll hand it off to the Eye, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.28,0:53:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就都能回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can all get the hell home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.84,0:53:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 汗内斯 老朋友 你能来真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannes, my old friend. So glad you could make it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.18,0:53:52.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道你特别钟情于老派投标\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you had a soft spot for an old-school bidding war.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.35,0:53:53.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How have you been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.52,0:53:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完全相信我手下的人 让他们处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust my people implicitly. What they say goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.23,0:54:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 但你肯定想亲自看一看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Certainly. But I'm sure you'd like to see it for yourself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:00.40,0:54:03.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿在手里检查一下质量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold it in your hands, check the build quality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.61,0:54:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者不看 没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not. Also fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.28,0:54:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,请各位跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you'd like to follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:13.79,0:54:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们必须取下身上的金属 手表 戒指之类的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to remove all your metal. Watches, rings, etc.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.29,0:54:20.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 - 冒昧问一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, of course. - Excuse me for asking…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.71,0:54:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前是不是在哪见过你们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where might I have seen you before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.88,0:54:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 可能是在我的座谈会上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, probably one of my many symposiums.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.38,0:54:27.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮书套\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book jacket!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.55,0:54:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得说 迈克尔拉斯基先生 我是你的忠实书迷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say, Dr. Michaelakis, I'm a huge fan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.47,0:54:32.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,噢 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.39,0:54:34.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪本书？我的书太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, which book? There have been so many…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.02,0:54:38.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,汗内斯经常跟你这样开玩笑吗 博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Hannes' chippy always talk for you, Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.61,0:54:41.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,医生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doctor?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.36,0:54:48.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 你说玩笑 我们就总认为是说这个家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, when you say "chippy, " you are referring to Buffy here, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.16,0:54:49.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.20,0:54:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,汗内斯更喜欢用「荡妇」来称他的所有小鲜肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hannes prefers the term "floozy" for all his boy toys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.71,0:54:58.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 记住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. He does. That's good. - Noted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:58.83,0:55:00.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 我收到了你的邮件 迈克尔拉斯基先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the way, I got your email, Dr. Michaelakis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.96,0:55:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你询问我们在温室…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had a query about our ability{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.55,0:55:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不使用稀释 冷冻和错误修正\N{\fnArial\fs30}to maintain quantum coherence at room temperature{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.71,0:55:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,维持量子相干性的能力提出了质疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}without the use of dilution, refrigerators, or error correction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.34,0:55:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以说明一下吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you care to elucidate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.05,0:55:12.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Right. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.47,0:55:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我是发过那封邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did send that email.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.52,0:55:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那天我看到了 - 是的 我发了 说什么来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The other day, I saw you. - I did, I sent it. So what gives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.56,0:55:18.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 什么来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, what gives…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:19.06,0:55:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想她想说的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think what she's trying to say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.69,0:55:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们专家在开会 巴菲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, the grown-ups are having a meeting, Buffy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.73,0:55:23.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.07,0:55:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你帮我拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you'll hold on to that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.40,0:55:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 没问题 博士 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, sure, Doctor. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.19,0:55:29.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 每个七年级的学生 甚至包括哪些蠢学生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, every seventh grader, even the dumb ones, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.74,0:55:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,都知道热力学第二定律\N{\fnArial\fs30}know the second law of thermodynamics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.87,0:55:35.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,「所有有序的系统 都将趋于无序状态」 无序\N{\fnArial\fs30}"All ordered systems tend toward disorder." Disorder!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:35.66,0:55:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我要再问你一次 先生 刚才说什么来着？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm going to ask you one more time, sir, what gives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:45.96,0:55:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这其实涉及到拓扑量子顺序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's actually topological quantum order.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.22,0:55:52.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是指量子效应在宏观的层面体现\N{\fnArial\fs30}The emergence of quantum effects on a macroscopic level.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.35,0:55:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是刚才我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that is, in fact, what gives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:00.27,0:56:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.90,0:56:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 巴菲这名字挺适合你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Buffy is not a bad name for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.03,0:56:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 巴夫 费姆 陶特\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, buff, firm, taut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.70,0:56:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很不错 你是在哪找了本字典吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good. Did you just find a thesaurus somewhere?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.58,0:56:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,努比莱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nubile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.96,0:56:22.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很好 谢谢你 - 好的 我们开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's good. Thank you. - Okay. There we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.30,0:56:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:41.14,0:56:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那手杖是金属的 我们怎么带出去？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stick's metal. How are we going to get it out?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:43.48,0:56:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.90,0:56:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the housing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:47.78,0:56:52.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,传输速度达到了八亿两千万量子英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}820 million qubit miles of digi-synaptic resonance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.70,0:57:00.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但无疑我们独霸全球之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}But of course, what sets us apart from anything else on the planet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.20,0:57:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是我们的处理器 我们玩笑的把它称为「魔法扫帚」\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the processor, which we playfully refer to as the Magic Broomstick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.00,0:57:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫帚？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Broomstick?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.09,0:57:09.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有着清理地球上 任何电脑系统内容\N{\fnArial\fs30}Has the power to clear the contents of any computing system on the planet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.88,0:57:12.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,并将其传输给你的能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then magically sweep them into your bin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.59,0:57:15.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,扫帚 真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Broomstick. That's funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.30,0:57:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看吧 随你怎么检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a look, vet it however you'd like, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.14,0:57:20.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后告诉汗内斯 我们将于周一投标\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell Hannes we'll be taking bids on Monday.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.68,0:57:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.85,0:57:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天 这里面肯定 有什么东西让我过敏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God. I must be allergic to something in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.61,0:57:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么可能在这里面 发生过敏反应呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What could you possibly be allergic to in here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.61,0:57:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这房间是密封的 - 就是它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This room is hermetically sealed. - That's it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.86,0:57:33.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来是对电子辐射过敏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm allergic to hermetic seals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:33.78,0:57:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 把他扶到一边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we could get him away from the computer, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.57,0:57:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是唯一的可能 - 让他恢复一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's the one thing. - Just until he's recovered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.33,0:57:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还需要点抗菌药…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need some anti-baa…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.04,0:57:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里有湿巾吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we have alcohol wipes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.87,0:57:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你要靠近 就必须确保手部是无菌的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your hands need to be sterile if you intend to get any closer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:45.29,0:57:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听明白了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I make myself clear?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.17,0:57:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 我们不能… - 不 我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry. We couldn't… - No, I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.05,0:57:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这药吃了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}…take his medicine into the country.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.34,0:57:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.93,0:58:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再接触过敏源了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't risk any contamination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.43,0:58:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候你得离它远一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to stay away from the inner workings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:03.27,0:58:04.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.73,0:58:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 如果你弄完了 - 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. If you're done… - Oh. Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.40,0:58:08.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉 好的 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry about this. Okay. I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.19,0:58:10.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有时就会如此 很快会过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This happens to him sometimes. It'll pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.40,0:58:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,过敏 你什么也做不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allergies. Nothing you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.36,0:58:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能做点什么 医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, something you could do, Doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.42,0:58:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:42.47,0:58:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,搜他的身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search him, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.56,0:58:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才不是搜过了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't we just do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.06,0:58:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们什么也没做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you serious?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:46.48,0:58:48.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我要全方位检查系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. I wanna run full diagnostics on the system.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.36,0:58:52.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这完全没有必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is completely unnecessary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:21.80,0:59:23.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,举手 举手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up, up, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.10,0:59:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.01,0:59:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我自己能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I can walk on my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:54.38,0:59:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:58.36,0:59:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.40,1:00:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:17.57,1:00:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我自己来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can do that myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.53,1:00:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们刚认识 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just met, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.86,1:00:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛手毛脚的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Handsy, handsy, handsy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.46,1:00:36.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.63,1:00:40.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的眼睛在这 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}My eyes are up here, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.53,1:00:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你喜欢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you like it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.20,1:01:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.22,1:01:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.14,1:01:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这有东西吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.47,1:01:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 不能相信任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Can't trust anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.64,1:01:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 他们是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm good. - They're clean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.35,1:01:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后检查一下 然后让他们出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do your final checks and get them out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.36,1:01:38.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 我们又走这边了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- OKay. - Oh, we're walking this way again. Yay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:44.20,1:01:47.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't speak the language.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.21,1:01:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.67,1:01:57.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我怎么跟你说的？我们什么都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did I tell you, man? We didn't have anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.54,1:02:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 伙计 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, pal. Appreciate that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.02,1:02:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个像白色舞池的东西 让我想摆动身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something about a big white dance floor, makes me wanna boogie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.86,1:02:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 感谢邀请我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, thanks for having us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.69,1:02:25.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西真不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's great stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.70,1:02:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.04,1:02:35.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的安保措施 还真是严格啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys are pretty serious about your security, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.96,1:02:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:40.63,1:02:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的东西都在吗 我觉得我进来的时候还带着更多的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have all my things? I feel like I came in with more stuff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.31,1:02:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在这里了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I come in with more stuff?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:46.88,1:02:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不这么想？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't think so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.22,1:02:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,先生 我想我的钱包还在你那\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, sir, I think you still have my wallet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.85,1:02:56.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得吗 我进来的时候给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, I, uh, gave it to you when I came in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.56,1:02:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想把它要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would be nice to leave with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:03.57,1:03:04.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,钱包要通过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wallet coming through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.45,1:03:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 是我的皮带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, my belt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:19.75,1:03:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.38,1:03:23.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想都在这了 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess that's everything, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.42,1:03:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.59,1:03:27.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那不是玩具 巴菲 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That is not a toy, Buffy. - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.35,1:03:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,走走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.48,1:03:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 在市场上放我下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Drop me off at the market{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:42.40,1:03:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要交给天眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I can get this to the Eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.23,1:03:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我在他们开始…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You asked me to call you when they started{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.53,1:03:47.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,像无头苍蝇一样跑路时打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}running around like headless chickens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.65,1:03:50.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 就是那么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's what's happening.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:04.84,1:04:07.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他们说的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where your sources told you they'd be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.55,1:04:11.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他只是告诉我 也许能在这找到答案\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is where my sources said we might find an answer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.52,1:04:24.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她肯定很了解你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She must be familiar with your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.36,1:04:25.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,打搅一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:25.86,1:04:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,小姐 你见过这些人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Miss, have you seen these people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.98,1:04:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,她说她的孙子跟他们的 老大说过话\N{\fnArial\fs30}She says her grandson spoke to their leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.21,1:04:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:44.04,1:04:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.34,1:04:47.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你会说普通话？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No "Wow, you speak Mandarin"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:18.87,1:05:21.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,大变活人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! The Coffin to the Beyond.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.50,1:05:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是涉及到暗门 陷阱或者镜子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was always a flap, or a trap or mirrors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.30,1:05:31.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,观众们认为他就那样消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The audience thought he'd just disappeared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.72,1:05:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是他总是藏在 里面的某个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was always hidden somewhere inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.31,1:05:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这就是你父亲 所做那东西的原型\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe that's the prototype for the one your father had made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.11,1:05:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和那些年的很多人一样 都是从这里订做道具的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He, like many others over the years, ordered his supplies from here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:56.24,1:05:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah! Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.45,1:06:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以当我说他们在澳门时 你给我摆脸色\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why you gave me the look when I said they were in Macau.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:03.25,1:06:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲在你小时候来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father used to come here when you were young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.50,1:06:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我一些空间吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I please get some space here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.46,1:06:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为你是唯一一个 对所发生的事情质疑了30年的人吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you think you're the only one who'd wondered for 30 years what happened…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.97,1:06:18.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you're not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.68,1:06:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,莱昂内尔是魔术大师\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lionel was a master magician.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.10,1:06:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要么在前面缠上锁链\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either he gamed the hinges, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.68,1:06:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就能踹开门跳出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he could kick the door and they would pop out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:26.27,1:06:30.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么使用内部的锁 这样就能开锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}or he had access to the lock from the inside so he could pick it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.19,1:06:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们说保险箱是廉价金属做的 所以很容易弄开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Word is the safe was made from cheap metal, and it bowed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.95,1:06:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总是留一手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, he always had something up his sleeve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.66,1:06:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,但最后他达到了他能力的极限用尽了技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless he'd reached the limit of his capabilities and his clock ran out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.09,1:06:56.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我奶奶那儿也许有你要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me. My grandmother has something you might want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:00.35,1:07:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你父亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was your father's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.68,1:07:04.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他订做了几个这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had several of these made.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:24.29,1:07:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么四骑士的事呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Horsemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.83,1:07:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我偶然听到他们谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I overheard them talking.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.04,1:07:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,当时他们其中一个叫阿特拉斯的\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them, Atlas, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.97,1:07:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,在附近的市场上见什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's meeting someone at the market nearby.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.77,1:07:52.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,至于前特工罗兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}As for former Agent Rhodes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.44,1:07:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,查清他的所在位置是我们的首要任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}his location is now your number one priority.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:55.11,1:07:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经发布了国际通告\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're putting out an international APB.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:57.36,1:08:00.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要当地部门的合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have Interpol, including cooperation from local authorities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:00.20,1:08:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,考恩特工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Cowan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:01.53,1:08:05.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你应该没有 进入纽堡联邦监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm assuming it was actually not you who walked into Newburgh Federal Prison, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.20,1:08:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后三十分钟后和 撒迪厄斯·布兰德利一起离开了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}then walked out 30 minutes later with Thaddeus Bradley?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:08.20,1:08:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 他用了你的证件\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - He used your ID.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.21,1:08:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在做什么 罗兹？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing, Rhodes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.62,1:08:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿特拉斯 嘿 - 迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Atlas, hey. - Dylan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.74,1:08:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我搞砸了 抱歉 - 你来这里做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I blew it, I'm sorry. - What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.37,1:08:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来帮忙的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to help now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.66,1:08:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们绝对不需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we definitely don't need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.04,1:08:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道我搞砸了 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know I messed up, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.41,1:08:52.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你让大家都身陷险境\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, you put everybody's lives in danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.00,1:08:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 大家在哪？- 大家在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is everybody? - Where is everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.42,1:08:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上不能被人看到 我和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't be seen with you, actually, right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.17,1:08:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了 好吗？我很感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it now, okay? I appreciate you taking{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.21,1:09:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抽出时间 来控制一下局势\N{\fnArial\fs30}the time to take control for a little while.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.84,1:09:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 我真的… 是吗？- 但是我知道了 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, I'm actually… Yeah? - Yeah, but I got it now, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.59,1:09:03.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You do? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.72,1:09:05.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来应该 好好的休息一下 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you can get some rest, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.14,1:09:07.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在这里等谁？- 我没等任何人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who you meeting here? - I'm not meeting anybody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.72,1:09:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们告诉我你在翁氏 见了什么人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They told me at long's you were meeting somebody.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.27,1:09:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,翁氏？\N{\fnArial\fs30}At long's?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:11.27,1:09:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 是的 不 我是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah, no, I am, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.15,1:09:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我见了来自「天眼」的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm meeting somebody from the Eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.65,1:09:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他们答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, no, they agreed to meet me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.94,1:09:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我们的命换这张电脑芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}to exchange this computer chip for our lives back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.03,1:09:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,事情就是这样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's what it's come to now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.36,1:09:24.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你对现在的状况感到开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hope you're happy with the situation you've put us in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:24.24,1:09:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和「天眼」谈过了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking to the Eye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.82,1:09:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.99,1:09:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为何和他们谈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you talking to the Eye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.83,1:09:32.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿特拉斯 阿特拉斯 给我晶片卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlas. Atlas, give me the stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.87,1:09:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 你已经不是我们的老大了 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, you're not our leader anymore, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.25,1:09:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是我们的英雄 你也不是FBI\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not our hero. You're not FBI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.96,1:09:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是魔术师 你根本什么也不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not a magician. You're not really anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.01,1:09:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们相信了你一年\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we trusted you for a year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:43.93,1:09:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以如果你真的想帮助我们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you really wanna help us… If you really…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.39,1:09:49.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你真想帮助我们 那你就离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you really wanna help us, you would leave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.44,1:10:00.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂了 好的 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. Cool. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.38,1:10:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, hello!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:19.67,1:10:22.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 你在魔术店联系的 那个人就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that was me you called at the magic shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.96,1:10:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是很有趣 我知道你在实验室会被我吓跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}So much fun though, knowing you'd be scurrying away from me at the lab{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.01,1:10:27.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我来了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}just to bring it to me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:27.51,1:10:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的认为我会让你走吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you actually think I'd let you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.22,1:10:31.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是怎么做到的？- 每个人都有自己的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you do that? - Everyone has their button.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.02,1:10:35.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦按下去 就变瞎了 而你的弱点就是自负\N{\fnArial\fs30}You push it and they go blind. And yours, obviously, is ego.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.06,1:10:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,「坚持到底\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Stay the course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.65,1:10:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨变即将发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great changes are in store.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.48,1:10:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信你独特的才能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust that your unique talents{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.07,1:10:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,将会被人所知「\N{\fnArial\fs30}will not go unrecognized."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.90,1:10:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个是你 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That was you. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.45,1:10:48.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,梅里特下载了所有的文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merritt downloaded all the files, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:49.03,1:10:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你认为我们是 怎么找到他的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but how do you think we were able to find him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:51.83,1:10:52.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your phone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.83,1:10:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想看看幕后黑手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked to see the face behind all of this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.87,1:11:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,被你手机录下的 其实是平板电脑的声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you actually put your phone on was a bi-wave siphon pad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.54,1:11:05.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,又一次科学战胜了魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once again, science beats magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.22,1:11:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 我要的东西呢？- 没在\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, the stick? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:11.64,1:11:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.72,1:11:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我这 在我这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.18,1:11:18.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 该死 迪伦 - 等等 别管他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Fuck, Dylan! - Wait, leave them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.14,1:11:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我会就那样离开？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I'm gonna walk away from you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.82,1:11:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我晶片卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me the stick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.86,1:11:22.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.02,1:11:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 别再质疑我 滚开\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Don't ever question me again. Beat it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.83,1:11:39.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 东西给我 - 去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So, the stick. - Go to hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.17,1:11:41.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.64,1:11:55.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry! I'm sorry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:11.87,1:12:13.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们可有不少人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's like 10 of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:13.37,1:12:15.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 他只是在耍小伎俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, he's just doing tricks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.24,1:12:17.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's there! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.66,1:13:45.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 看着这会飞的小鸟 睡着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, watch the pretty birdies fly. And sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:45.83,1:13:49.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对我可没用 - 难道就不能让你分心吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Doesn't work on me. - Not even as a distraction?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.84,1:13:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 干的好 - 还是自己动手好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good job. - Nice to be involved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:02.73,1:14:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 各位 各位 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys! Guys! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:04.85,1:14:07.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我刚才见到了迪伦 出事了 - 你说这话是什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I just saw Dylan, something happened. - What do you mean you just saw Dylan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.56,1:14:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦在这里？发生什么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan's here? What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:09.69,1:14:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 阿特拉斯 - 我不知道 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Atlas. - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:16.99,1:14:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are they doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:18.24,1:14:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些是沃尔特的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those are Walter's men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.74,1:14:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他们要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what they want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.87,1:14:26.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞什么？怎么还在你手上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell? How do you still have that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.05,1:14:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是莱昂内尔·施莱克的保险箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa. That's Lionel Shrike's safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.92,1:14:35.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要用那个做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do they want with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.51,1:14:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们得跟着那卡车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we gotta follow that truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.34,1:14:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦肯定在他们手上 我们的时间不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}They must have Dylan. We don't have much time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.06,1:14:46.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.39,1:14:51.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道一些非常重要的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You to understand something very important.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.11,1:14:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是镜像\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are mirror images.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.44,1:14:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 和你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, because like you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.82,1:14:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和我父亲 有着很深的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I share a very deep connection with my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.45,1:15:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且和你一样 我将不惜一切代价为他进行复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}And like you, I'll stop at nothing to avenge any wrongs done to him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.08,1:15:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道你父亲和我父亲 唯一的区别吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know the only difference between your father and mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.71,1:15:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine's still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:15.30,1:15:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.02,1:15:34.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 就是这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, this is the man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.44,1:15:37.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,花了一辈子时间暗算我\N{\fnArial\fs30}who spent a lifetime plotting against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.53,1:15:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使你的巨幅海报挂在 我的卧室窗户外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have known your face{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.91,1:15:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也认不出来你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}if it had been on a billboard outside my bedroom window.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.50,1:15:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却花了30年时间一直算计我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you have spent, what, 3O years thinking about mine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.25,1:15:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,当我父亲死的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When my father died, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:50.58,1:15:52.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的保险公司 拒绝了我母亲的请求\N{\fnArial\fs30}your insurance company denied my mother her claims.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.79,1:15:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 她穷苦而死 - 我甚至不知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wouldn't even have known… - She died a pauper!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.21,1:15:56.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的母亲是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}…who your mother was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.13,1:16:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,她只是个数字 一连串资料的十亿分之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was a digit, a nanobyte in a stream of data.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.80,1:16:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你不关心任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because nothing is personal to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.85,1:16:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人和任何事对于 你来说都只是数字 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and everyone and everything is just a number, isn't that so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.18,1:16:07.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正是你错的地方 罗兹先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is where you are wrong, Mr. Rhodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.89,1:16:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦你出名了 那就跟你有关了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once you made yourself known it became very personal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.07,1:16:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的儿子… - 是的 反社会的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My son… - Yeah, the sociopath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.98,1:16:20.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,有趣的是 我有七个所谓的婚生子女\N{\fnArial\fs30}Funny thing is, I have seven so-called legitimate children.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:20.66,1:16:23.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们虚情假意 十分势力 而且愚蠢无比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sniveling, snobbish, stupid runts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.74,1:16:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我有一个和我一样的私生子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have one illegitimate child who is a lot like me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.79,1:16:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,问题是 他想要一些东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The point is, he wants something, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.25,1:16:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,像那些好的父母一样 我将不惜一切代价让他获得\N{\fnArial\fs30}and like any good parent, I will stop at nothing to get it for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:35.46,1:16:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西就在你的骑士身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your Horsemen have it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.30,1:16:41.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会把它和他们 现在就交给我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will turn it and them over to us, now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:41.68,1:16:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:46.51,1:16:49.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 我很希望你好好记住这一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, I would like you to really take this moment in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.35,1:16:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这就是你一心报私仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}because this is the consequence of your personal vendetta come to life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.85,1:16:54.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,反被将了一军的结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}and staring you in the face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:54.69,1:16:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你知道就算你归西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want you to know that when you're gone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:56.52,1:16:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也不会停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're not going to stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:57.65,1:16:59.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将毁了你相信的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna destroy everything you believe in, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:59.82,1:17:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,先从四骑士开始 最后毁了「天眼」\N{\fnArial\fs30}starting with the Horsemen, and ending with the Eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.11,1:17:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 鼓起你的勇气\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now then, cast your mind back{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.07,1:17:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,站在这亲眼目睹你父亲失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}to standing by the banks of the river watching your father descend, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:07.29,1:17:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,遭遇耻辱并名誉扫地的河岸边\N{\fnArial\fs30}disgraced and discredited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:09.37,1:17:12.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些年来你感受到的恐惧\N{\fnArial\fs30}The horrid psychic pain as you have relived for years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.87,1:17:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感受到同样的感觉 两年前你不仅毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt that same thing two years ago{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:16.25,1:17:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲的前途 还有他的尊严\N{\fnArial\fs30}as you drained not just my father's fortune, but his dignity!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:19.92,1:17:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却从中得到快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you took pleasure from it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.76,1:17:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该能给你带回一些童年记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}This should bring back some childhood memories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.75,1:17:56.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 想喝点茶吗？- 谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Would you like some tea? - Oh. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:12.31,1:18:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你准备好了吗？- 请便\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You ready? - Over to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.61,1:18:22.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,水花\N{\fnArial\fs30}Splash!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.20,1:18:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,完事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Job done!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.21,1:18:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来还得等不少时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell is going to seem like a day at the spa{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.68,1:18:49.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候我们就把骑士灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}by the time we're through with these Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.22,1:18:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你说呢？- 完全正确\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wouldn't you say? - You had me at "hell."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.78,1:19:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我非常爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.74,1:19:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我每次都会给自己留一手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always keep something up my sleeve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:34.95,1:20:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望我能洗净自己的灵魂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could dredge from the muck of my soul{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:38.08,1:20:42.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,让它毫无污秽 但这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}one speck of remorse, but I can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.25,1:20:48.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我会继续做着生意 并试着别笑得太明显\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'll stick to the business at hand and try not to smile too broadly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:48.76,1:20:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 谢谢你 为我送来迪伦·罗兹先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, thank you for delivering Mr. Dylan Rhodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:54.89,1:20:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想这事已经完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I take it it's done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:57.93,1:20:59.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多沉睡在海底了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally hit the bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:00.48,1:21:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么 四骑士在哪？- 他们只是表演的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now, where are the Horsemen? - They're performers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.32,1:21:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的骄傲和自负 他们对于名气的渴望 实在是太强烈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their pride, their ego, their need to be adored are all too powerful{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.95,1:21:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们无法隐藏太久\N{\fnArial\fs30}to keep them out of the limelight for long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:13.91,1:21:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果找不到他们 你就会发现你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they don't make themselves known, you will find yourself{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:19.50,1:21:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,和罗兹先生一样 处于一个十分相似的情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a very similar position to Mr. Rhodes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:23.54,1:21:27.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 清楚了吗？- 像他沉入的水一样清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are we clear about that? - As clear as the water he's under.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.89,1:21:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住骑士之后 再给你剩下的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have the rest when I have the Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:10.71,1:22:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:13.22,1:22:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 拜托 醒醒伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, come on, buddy, breathe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.63,1:22:16.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 迪伦 - 迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dylan. - Dylan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:16.93,1:22:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 醒醒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.27,1:22:24.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.06,1:22:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 你吓坏我们了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus! You scared the hell out of us, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.86,1:22:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 伙计？- 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right, bro? - Okay!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.57,1:22:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 - 这是我起码能做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you! - This is the least I could do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.61,1:22:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你本可以袖手旁观的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. There's a hell of a lot less you could've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.61,1:22:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可不会那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not an option.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.99,1:22:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我们挡了子弹 那可是大恩情\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took a bullet for us, it was huge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.95,1:22:41.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的做到了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really did, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:44.58,1:22:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,说真的 感谢你们救我出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for pulling me out. Seriously.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.25,1:22:48.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.67,1:22:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自己出来的 我们只是拉你出水\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got yourself out. We did the easy part.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.88,1:22:53.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的 因为我当时 只是站在岸边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Literally, in my case, I was just standing on the shore{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.21,1:22:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是阿特拉斯跳下水 找到你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}while Atlas jumped down and got you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.14,1:22:55.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm serious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.72,1:22:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 各位 有点不对劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you guys. Something's not right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:58.68,1:23:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了？- 怎么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's wrong? - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.01,1:23:04.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是假的 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's fake. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.06,1:23:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我拿到了芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I had the stick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.69,1:23:10.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的芯片 我发誓是真的 就在我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}The actual stick. I swear, it was in my hand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.40,1:23:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我把它放在一个小盒子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}in the lab, and then I put it in the little case thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:12.98,1:23:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 然后给了阿特拉斯 - 对 后来我交给迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And I gave it to Atlas. - Right, which I then gave to Dylan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.19,1:23:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有没有可能 是你错放在什么地方了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there any chance you've possibly misplaced it at any point?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.78,1:23:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我从你手里把它拿走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I took it from you and then slipped it back in your coat{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:21.24,1:23:22.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后把你推开时又还给了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I pushed you out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:23.08,1:23:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,总之 我们这次算是栽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, we're left holding a whole sack full of nada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:26.37,1:23:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但他们还是会认为 东西就在我们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but they're gonna come after us as if we do have something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.04,1:23:32.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 好的 我同意有人 战胜了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Okay. I agree that somebody got the better of us. Okay? Somehow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:32.46,1:23:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我不认为我们就一败涂地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I don't agree that we have a sack full of nada.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.96,1:23:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们都在这 这才是最重要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're all here. That's a sack full of something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.13,1:23:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们都知道沃尔特 不得到芯片不会停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we all know that Walter is not going to stop until he gets that chip.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.89,1:23:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们是唯一 知道他还活着的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're the only ones that even know that he's alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:49.52,1:23:54.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能就这样不管了 这可不是骑士的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just walk away. That's not what the Horsemen do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.90,1:23:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一段话\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a quote. Um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.78,1:24:00.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话是一个魔术师说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's actually by the magician{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.28,1:24:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是他让我走上了这条路\N{\fnArial\fs30}that made me wanna do this in the first place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:02.12,1:24:04.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,说的是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.12,1:24:10.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,「魔术师最大的力量 永远深藏于他的空拳」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"A magician's greatest power lies forever shrouded in his empty fist."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.88,1:24:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,「然而他能说服世人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"And the very idea that he can convince the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.29,1:24:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,「他确实握有秘密」\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he is, in fact, carrying with him a secret."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.51,1:24:19.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是莱昂内尔·施莱克说的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's Lionel Shrike. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:20.59,1:24:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你的意思是我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what are you saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.76,1:24:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,要假装我们手头有没有的东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That we should pretend like we have something we don't?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:28.02,1:24:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 沃尔特最大的恐惧是什么？- 被曝光\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is Walter's greatest fear? - Being seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.52,1:24:35.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那芯片是做什么的？- 那芯片可以破译一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what does the stick do? - The stick can unencode anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:35.61,1:24:40.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,它可以悄然入侵这星球上的任何一台电脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can open up a back door into any computer on the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:40.61,1:24:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 包括他的 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Including his. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.24,1:24:46.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们不仅要让他认为 芯片在我们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, we not only make him think that we have it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.74,1:24:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要让他以为我们将用 芯片将他彻底毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that we're going to use it to expose and destroy him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.91,1:24:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要个计划 但我们没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need a plan. But we don't have time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:54.38,1:24:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有彼此 而且我们有五个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have each other and there are five of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.92,1:25:00.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们还需要惊喜 对吧？还有必要的道具和资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we also need supplies, right? And resources.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:00.92,1:25:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者更多的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And probably more than five people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.26,1:25:08.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真认为没人帮你们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think you don't have help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.22,1:25:10.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会说英语 当然了 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, she speaks English. Of course. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.06,1:25:16.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为何「愚者」是 塔罗牌中力量最大的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know why the Fool is the most powerful card in the tarot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.57,1:25:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为抽到它的人就是愚者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not because the person who draws him is a fool.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.28,1:25:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他愚 因为他是一张白纸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a fool because he's a clean slate, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:24.78,1:25:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,因此可以成为 无所不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}and, therefore, can become anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.79,1:25:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是被选择的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were chosen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.87,1:25:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.75,1:25:37.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是因为你们是谁 而是因为你们将取得的成绩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not because of who you are, but because of who you might become.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.59,1:25:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你说「被选择」 你是「天眼」的一部分？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you say "chosen"… Are you part of the Eye?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:43.51,1:25:47.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们是「天眼」的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. We are part of the Eye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.64,1:25:50.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都怀疑我们的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've each doubted our existence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.68,1:25:55.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,想知道 我们是否在观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wondering if we, indeed, were watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.61,1:26:03.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们确实在观察 我们一直如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are. We always have been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.32,1:26:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可是世界上最好的魔术店\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the best magic shop in the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.91,1:26:08.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白她说的 对吧？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You know what she's saying, right? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.20,1:26:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们有了资源和帮手\N{\fnArial\fs30}That now we have resources and help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.41,1:26:13.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:16.25,1:26:17.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 谁加入？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, who's in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:21.71,1:26:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我加入 - 是的 我加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm in. - Yeah, I'm in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:27.14,1:26:28.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开干吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.86,1:26:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.20,1:26:52.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不久前 我们被人耍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not long ago, we were tricked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:52.41,1:26:55.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被人发现没有死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was exposed and brought back from the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:55.41,1:26:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们觉得唯一的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we thought it was only fitting that we do the same thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:58.33,1:27:02.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是以牙还牙 - 除夕 午夜 伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to the person who did it to us. - Midnight, New Year's Eve. London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:02.76,1:27:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们将进行一连串的表演 那将会是我们的绝唱\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will be performing a series of shows that all connect to our big finale, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:06.09,1:27:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你们得好好看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}so pay close attention to each trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:08.30,1:27:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫我父亲来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get my father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:11.56,1:27:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Run!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:12.72,1:27:15.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要找国际刑警 苏格兰场 能找的帮手都找上\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want Interpol, Scotland Yard, whoever we have in London.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:15.98,1:27:17.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兹方面有什么消息？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do we know about Rhodes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:17.31,1:27:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管骑士们在哪 他都会在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever the Horsemen are, that's where he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:19.23,1:27:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去机场吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to the airport.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:20.44,1:27:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,留小孩在家 准备享受疯狂夜晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}So leave your kiddies at home and get ready for a wild night, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.90,1:27:25.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们也会让某人死而复生\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we, too, will bring someone back from the dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:26.07,1:27:27.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位行动吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's move, everyone!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.95,1:27:29.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,在世界最大的舞台前面…\N{\fnArial\fs30}In front of the largest stage in the world…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.91,1:27:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,真实的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}The actual world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:31.91,1:27:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道他们在耍你 对吧？把你引入陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know they're playing you, right? Leading you into a trap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.75,1:27:37.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 但这威胁是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but the threat is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.50,1:27:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这张芯片可以黑进 地球上任何的电脑 包括我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This card can hack into any system on the planet, including ours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.25,1:27:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在芯片在他们手上 他们为何就不会用？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have it, why wouldn't they use it to expose us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:42.55,1:27:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我们所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me. Everything we've done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:44.13,1:27:46.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是真的吗 麦金尼先生？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it real, Mr. McKinney?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:53.56,1:27:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这威胁是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The threat is real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.89,1:27:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们要怎么对付他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how do we stay ahead of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:57.23,1:27:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得在午夜赶到伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to get to London by midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:08.32,1:28:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在在伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are here in London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:09.91,1:28:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,除夕夜充满了人群\N{\fnArial\fs30}on this New Year's Eve, and the crowds are out in force.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:12.49,1:28:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,当地人和游客们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Locals and tourists alike{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.03,1:28:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好参加年度大派对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting ready for the party of the year.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.25,1:28:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,一段跟四骑士有关的视频\N{\fnArial\fs30}A video gone viral from the infamous{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.25,1:28:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经在网上疯传了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Horsemen magicians has surfaced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.17,1:28:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们承诺会盛大复出\N{\fnArial\fs30}They promise to make a grand reappearance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:21.92,1:28:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但结局会是他们在全国电视上被捕或证明清白？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But will it end in their arrest on national television?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.09,1:28:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者说只是一个噱头？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or some sort of vindication?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.84,1:28:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,天晓得他们会在哪里出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who knows where they'll show up…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.01,1:28:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们知道不管何时何地\N{\fnArial\fs30}remake reporter H But we do know, wherever, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.47,1:28:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们会拭目以待\N{\fnArial\fs30}whenever that is, people will be watching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.31,1:28:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 短信 推特 博客\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, texts, tweets, lnstagrams.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.31,1:28:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何和骑士有关系的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything that says "Horsemen, " brags about seeing the Horsemen, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.35,1:28:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,都给我跟一跟\N{\fnArial\fs30}tag them and bundle them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.10,1:28:44.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 这一次担任保安的是谁 是你们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, who do we have security-wise on this? Your guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:44.57,1:28:45.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要谁都行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.82,1:28:47.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,都带上 再加上一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we want all of them and all their friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:47.78,1:28:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让任何想赚外快的人随时待命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone who wants to work stationed throughout the city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.90,1:28:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,60秒立即出现在全市各处\N{\fnArial\fs30}so they can be anywhere in 60 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.00,1:29:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.22,1:29:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫杰克·怀尔德\N{\fnArial\fs30}My name's Jack Wilder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.84,1:29:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的 回来的感觉真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goddamn, it feels good to be back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.03,1:29:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 都过来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, gather around. Indulge me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.56,1:29:20.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要跟你们分享一些消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanna talk to you about something real quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.85,1:29:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们都知道三张扑克戏法 也被叫做「找小姐」戏法吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You all know Three Card Monte, also known as "Find the Lady"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:24.81,1:29:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在全世界由老千表演的戏法 为什么是老千？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trick performed by street hustlers all over the world. And why street hustlers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.19,1:29:32.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为只要你靠近桌子 你就输了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because as soon as you walk up to the table, you lose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.15,1:29:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都是如此 让我示范一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every time. Let me demonstrate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:36.58,1:29:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此期间 我们找一个活生生的女王\N{\fnArial\fs30}While we're at it, let's find ourselves a life-sized Queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.79,1:29:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士 你能当我的女王吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ma'am, would you mind being my Queen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:46.04,1:29:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我向你保证 回来的机会是五成\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry. I promise you there's a 50 percent chance{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:48.46,1:29:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,表演结束后你活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}you'll get her back after the show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.84,1:29:51.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,到那边去 非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Head over there. Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.72,1:29:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我们来找一些 服侍女王的杰克吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's find ourselves some Jacks to serve our Queen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.30,1:29:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust me, gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.68,1:30:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道了这些家伙的计划 他们先是开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how these guys work now. They're gonna start with a tease.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.52,1:30:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,来点暖场\N{\fnArial\fs30}A few little pop-ups.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.56,1:30:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,弄点手段引诱你加入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something to lure you in. Like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.52,1:30:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 就像他们现在表演的节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, like Three Card Monte, where the guy goes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:09.73,1:30:12.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,「看这里 但是不 不 看这里」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Looky here, but no, no, looky here!"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.36,1:30:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,当那些技巧弄完后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except when all these little tricks are done, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:16.37,1:30:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将看到的唯一东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only thing you're gonna be looking at{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.53,1:30:22.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是让你感到吃惊的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the inside of your own colon, with the words{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.58,1:30:25.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,写着「骑士」的卡片\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Horsemen" written all over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:26.25,1:30:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是通红的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.88,1:30:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们收到图像了 麦金尼先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get the picture, Mr. McKinney.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.42,1:30:33.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再坐我的椅子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And get out of my chair.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.55,1:30:35.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.84,1:30:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠近一点 来呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come close, come on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:37.89,1:30:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 好的 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right, so listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.89,1:30:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 我将利用真实的魔术飞起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, I am going to make something fly using actual magic.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.44,1:30:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 准备好了吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you ready? - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:47.27,1:30:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要利用一辆大型的船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to take a very large vessel, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:50.40,1:30:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让它飞起来 然后在泰晤士河着陆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make it fly over there and land on the Thames.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:54.82,1:30:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能接受吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you handle that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.74,1:30:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,和以前的规则一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same rules apply as before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.37,1:31:00.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要做的就是仔细看着皇后\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you need to do is keep your eye on the Queen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.53,1:31:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's as simple as that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:01.95,1:31:03.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们准备好了吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you guys ready? - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.75,1:31:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.54,1:31:07.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这消息是从哪来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tag this one. Where does it come from?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.96,1:31:10.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,河边 看来表演开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Near the river. Looks like the shows are starting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:10.17,1:31:11.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但发现他们的不止我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're not the only ones who found them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.75,1:31:13.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？- 在一号频道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What do you mean? - It's on Channel One.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.64,1:31:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 转到第2频道 - 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's go to 2. - Here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.93,1:31:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他了 他在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got him. We have a location.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:25.60,1:31:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,是杰克·怀尔德 骑士出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's Jack Wilder. Here come the Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.64,1:31:29.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 行动 行动 行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we're moving. Let's go, let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:29.69,1:31:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在比对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typing in grid coordinates now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.19,1:31:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,转身 藏在牌后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn around. Hide yourselves with the cards.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.49,1:31:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开始了 交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we go. Switch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.16,1:31:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还盯着她吗？要我去后面看看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys still have your eye on her? You want me to go back and do it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:43.37,1:31:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我继续 交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right. I'm moving on. And switch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:48.42,1:31:49.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is she?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:50.83,1:31:52.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边 你们确定？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Down at the end? You sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.96,1:31:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 后面的伙计 能击鼓吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, can I get a drumroll from my man in the back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.84,1:31:57.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.68,1:32:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's my girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.23,1:32:08.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我的姑娘 是你的姑娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not my girl, 100 percent your girl.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.94,1:32:10.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在这样的情况下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But just in this situation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:10.35,1:32:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 但我得先暖暖场 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, but I gotta warm up a little bit first. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:13.07,1:32:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我们先飞点小东西 比如…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, let me just make something small fly, like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.03,1:32:19.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞飞飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly, fly, fly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.24,1:32:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,对吧 看看啊 拜托 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow, right? Look at that! Aw. Come on, people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:22.74,1:32:25.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真无情 你 飞起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough crowd. You, fly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:25.70,1:32:26.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我？- 看看你的衣服里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - Check your fly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.28,1:32:31.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们喜欢吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:32.04,1:32:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们接受这个设定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You support that relationship?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:34.00,1:32:36.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那家伙的裤子里藏着鸽子 真是太恶心了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy had a bird in his pants. That's disgusting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:40.55,1:32:42.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 我们收到了两份报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. We've got two sightings reported.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:42.68,1:32:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 正在前往格林威治市场 - 给我找撒迪厄斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Heading to Greenwich Market. - Get me Thaddeus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:45.68,1:32:47.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,撒迪厄斯 FBI来了 他们已经行动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thaddeus, the FBI are here. They're moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:48.06,1:32:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他们去吧 那正中四骑士的下怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let 'em move. That's what the Horsemen want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:51.23,1:32:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他们先赶到？那就惨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what if they get there first? That can't happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:52.98,1:32:55.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证他们找不到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guarantee you, they won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:55.19,1:32:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到他们的所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find the pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:32:57.36,1:33:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有这样 你才能在它们开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do that, and you'll be able to cut them off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:00.40,1:33:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,最后的表演前阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}before they get to their final trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:02.87,1:33:06.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想更放心的话 我来替你摆平FBI\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it makes you feel better, I'll take care of the FBI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.88,1:33:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, well, I guess you found me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:22.38,1:33:23.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三个找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got a third spot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:24.05,1:33:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 各位 我们有模型了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, everybody, we're getting a pattern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:28.93,1:33:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,调到二频道 13和21\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um… Give me two, 13 and 21.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:35.06,1:33:37.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么？暂停 放大\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that? Freeze that and zoom in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.07,1:33:42.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How the hell did this happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:42.95,1:33:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,他死了 我们看着他沉下去 这怎么可能？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's dead. We watched him drown. How the hell did this happen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:46.16,1:33:48.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就先接受现实 目前最首要的问题是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Given that it did happen, the pertinent question is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:48.74,1:33:49.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}what are we gonna do about it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:49.83,1:33:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要阻止他 爸爸 我们要阻止他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna stop him, Dad. We'll stop him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:51.66,1:33:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的外套在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's my coat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:52.83,1:33:55.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特 恕我直言 我从来没看好过保险箱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter, for the record, I never loved the safe idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.63,1:33:57.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他们去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I know where they're going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:57.25,1:33:59.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来的表演是梅里特的 地点就在河边\N{\fnArial\fs30}The next show is Merritt's and it's by the river.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:33:59.92,1:34:01.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase, you need to get to him{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:01.38,1:34:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样就能 找到骑士 并阻止他们之后的行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we can find the Horsemen's entry point for the finale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:09.22,1:34:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要忏悔 据说我有一些控制方面的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a confession to make. I've been told I have some control issues.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:12.98,1:34:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很努力的学着如何控制人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've learned that it's really, really hard to control people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:16.40,1:34:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我将试着控制一些 比人简单的多的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I'm gonna try to control something that's a lot easier than people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:20.40,1:34:21.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要试着控制天气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna try to control the weather.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:22.58,1:34:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 雨水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, rain, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.16,1:34:27.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,要让天下雨有点困难 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'd be a little difficult to make it rain, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:27.87,1:34:30.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是只有神能做到的事情 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be something that only God can do, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:30.70,1:34:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要做一些连神也做不到的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna do something that God can't do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:33.08,1:34:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不仅仅要让雨停\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not just gonna make it clear up. No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.04,1:34:38.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让它完全停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna make it actually stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.43,1:34:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,神能做到那些吗？嗯 不 我想不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}And can God do that? Mmm. No, I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:54.73,1:34:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么让它上升呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or what about make it go up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.74,1:35:06.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们还在看吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you still with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:06.82,1:35:09.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着 王后在左边 开始吧 转身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch the Queen on the left. Let's do it. Turn around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:13.25,1:35:14.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switch!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:18.08,1:35:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我女士在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me the lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.33,1:35:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Show me the lady!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:22.21,1:35:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边 这边？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The end? End?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:25.88,1:35:27.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗？我开始觉得不太妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I'm actually starting to feel kinda bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:29.01,1:35:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是因为我能确实感受到 你们很专心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just because I can actually feel that you guys are paying attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:32.18,1:35:33.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:33.89,1:35:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 很不幸的是 你们都错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's unfortunate that it's the wrong kind of attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:38.56,1:35:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们需要更新的鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we need a fresher bird.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.23,1:35:45.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,它真可爱 真可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's so cute. He's so cute!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.40,1:35:47.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了它吧 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's kill him, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:48.24,1:35:52.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅里特 就位 - 知道了 迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Merritt, move into position. - Got it, Dylan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:52.28,1:35:53.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在路上 我们在那见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm on my way. I'll see you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.04,1:35:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁拉 待命 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lula, stand by, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:56.50,1:35:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么就那样… 我不知道 疯狂起来如何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, what about just go, I don't know, just go insane?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:08.38,1:36:10.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,伦敦各地发来报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reports are coming in from all over London{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:10.93,1:36:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像骑士为了表演 接管了整座城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the Horsemen appear to have taken over the whole city for their show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:17.56,1:36:21.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计 你这是去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, broski-whaddya-knowski? Where you headed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:21.31,1:36:22.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 伙计 别这么做 - 你去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please, bro, don't do this. - Where are you headed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.69,1:36:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,北 南 东\N{\fnArial\fs30}North, south, east?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.36,1:36:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,东 伦敦塔？\N{\fnArial\fs30}East. Tower of London?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:26.94,1:36:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,塔桥还是塔桥附近？泰晤士河\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tower Bridge? Near Tower Bridge? The Thames!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:29.78,1:36:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去泰晤士河 你真容易得手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to the Thamesy-Whemsy! You're so easy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:34.41,1:36:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 如果我们能交个朋友的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bro, if there's any chance of us ever having a relationship…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:37.12,1:36:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,不可能的 你的入口在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's not. Where's your entry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:39.58,1:36:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,南岸？格林威治？格林威治\N{\fnArial\fs30}South Bank? Greenwich? Greenwich.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:43.46,1:36:47.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要去哪 我知道你要…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where you're going. I know where…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:48.42,1:36:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, hobo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:52.72,1:36:55.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 梅里特 拜托 告诉我你在开玩笑 如何了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Merritt. Oh, come on. Tell me you're kidding. How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:57.02,1:36:58.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:36:58.48,1:37:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 好的 好的 我知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. All right. All right, I got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:01.19,1:37:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,别担心 我会警告他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about it. I'll warn the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:06.19,1:37:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Just…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:10.53,1:37:11.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？我告诉过你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I just told you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:11.70,1:37:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,来电话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Phone call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:14.12,1:37:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 喂？- 鲁拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello? - Lula.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.28,1:37:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,迪伦 是的 我现在有点忙呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dylan. Ah, yeah, kind of in the middle of something right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:18.70,1:37:21.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧完事 来集合地见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrap it up. Meet me at the rendezvous point now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:21.37,1:37:22.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:23.33,1:37:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是神的举动吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that an act of God?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:25.38,1:37:28.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不 那是我的举动\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, no, no, that was an act of me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.55,1:37:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有闪光灯 还有降雨机\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the strobe lights and rain machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:31.80,1:37:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你们注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hope you guys were paying attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:33.80,1:37:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是到了最后 你们得知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you're gonna need to know all of that for the final.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:39.56,1:37:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我是怎么做到的 我有使用隐形门帘？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how did I do it? Did I use a Barry Trap?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:42.73,1:37:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是一些开关或者复制品？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe some switches or a few duplicates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:45.11,1:37:46.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克 闪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack, go now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:46.23,1:37:47.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗？我也不想这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what? I hate to say it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:47.36,1:37:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们得自己找出来 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to wait to find out. I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:49.19,1:37:51.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉 我也爱你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry. I love you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:55.03,1:37:56.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲁拉 闪人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lula, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:37:56.20,1:37:58.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:17.14,1:38:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,让开 FBI 走走走 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Out of the way, FBI! Move, move, move! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:21.43,1:38:23.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,派人去停车场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get some men in that park!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:23.23,1:38:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Men in the park, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:24.44,1:38:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要吃开胃菜？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna fill up on appetizers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:26.65,1:38:29.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是等着吃大餐？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or save room for the main course?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:29.36,1:38:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑士在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell are the Horsemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:31.23,1:38:32.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这样大张旗鼓\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can chase them all you want, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:32.57,1:38:35.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,只会让他们防备\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're just gonna wind up holding your own tails.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:36.03,1:38:38.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你可以让他们 自己找上你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or, you can let them come to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:38.91,1:38:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们要怎么做？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what's it gonna be?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:40.58,1:38:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,追赶他们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chase them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:42.70,1:38:44.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是跟我打个商量？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or make a deal with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:50.55,1:38:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来？我们怎么又被发现了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again? How did we get found out again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:52.42,1:38:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 没事的 我们只要表演最后的节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fine, it's fine. We'll just cut to the finale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.26,1:38:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 梅里特在哪？- 好吧 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Merritt? - Fine. I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:55.84,1:38:56.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:56.93,1:38:58.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲁拉在哪？- 我在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Lula? - I'm right here!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:38:58.80,1:39:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生什么事了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:00.76,1:39:02.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的兄弟出现了 - 别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- My goddamn brother happened. - Don't worry about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.72,1:39:04.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只要去目的地\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just gotta get to the destination.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.27,1:39:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲁拉 你会骑那个吗？- 我完全会骑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lula, can you handle that thing? - I can ride it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:06.27,1:39:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是问他们 还是仅仅问我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you asked the guys that question, or just me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:08.36,1:39:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 说的好 - 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, good point. - Let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:09.69,1:39:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:15.45,1:39:16.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.41,1:39:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,杰克被抓了 我们得救他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jack's down. We gotta get him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:24.20,1:39:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:30.71,1:39:32.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 杰克 走 走 - 那是刹车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jack! Go, go! - That's the brake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:33.05,1:39:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是油门 你会明白的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the gas. You'll figure it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.71,1:39:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, follow me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.68,1:39:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.32,1:39:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 准备好了吗？- 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, ready? - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:03.74,1:40:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:08.92,1:40:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 好的 各位 我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah! - Okay, guys, I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:11.13,1:40:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:14.88,1:40:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm coming!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:24.76,1:40:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 起来 快点 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get up! Come on! - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:27.98,1:40:29.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你抓到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:29.27,1:40:31.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,那东西实在是太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things are really dangerous!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:33.19,1:40:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:37.19,1:40:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他进去 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him in! Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:43.78,1:40:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:45.54,1:40:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are they?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:47.87,1:40:49.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们随时会出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}They should be arriving any second.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.17,1:40:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要他们午夜前到就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is, if they're gonna get here by midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.89,1:41:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 感受恐惧吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, feeling fear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:08.64,1:41:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐惧 愤怒 愤怒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fear. Anger, anger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:12.02,1:41:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 满座了 - 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, full house! - That's enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:16.65,1:41:18.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:18.99,1:41:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,再次见到你们真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So nice to see you all again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:23.16,1:41:28.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但既然我们是老朋友 我们就别废话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But since we're such old friends, let's skip the formalities.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:29.66,1:41:34.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们其中一个人 有着我们需要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of you has something we require.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:36.09,1:41:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它交出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}So give it over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:45.93,1:41:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,真没有？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:49.98,1:41:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:41:53.69,1:41:55.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sit down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:02.28,1:42:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:04.95,1:42:06.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go, let's go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:06.37,1:42:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,别给他们任何 机会做任何事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up and move them quickly before they can do anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:09.04,1:42:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要照着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those lights off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:16.00,1:42:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:19.59,1:42:21.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ow! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:24.38,1:42:25.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,上飞机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get on the plane!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:35.02,1:42:36.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 喔 喔 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey! - Whoa, whoa, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:36.35,1:42:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 马上起飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, uh, take off immediately.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:41.65,1:42:44.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这事情太简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you make it almost too easy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:44.36,1:42:48.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 即使你们刷了些手段让你们的行踪不可捉摸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, even your hilarious attempts to make yourselves unpredictable, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:48.12,1:42:49.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次都让人找错\N{\fnArial\fs30}just follow the same pattern each time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:50.04,1:42:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,诡计 诡计 诡计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Set up, set up, set up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:52.12,1:42:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,大爆料\N{\fnArial\fs30}Big reveal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:53.46,1:42:55.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚的大戏会在午夜整点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which tonight was going to be stroke of midnight, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:42:55.92,1:42:58.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰晤士河的中间？跟我说说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}middle of the Thames? Tell me if I'm warm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:03.55,1:43:07.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,会有巨大揭露的 而且是马上上演\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there will be a big reveal, and it will come now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:09.10,1:43:12.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,芯片 乖小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}The stick, dear boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:12.77,1:43:14.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:14.60,1:43:16.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,从她开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}Start with her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:16.90,1:43:19.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, hey, hey, hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:21.40,1:43:24.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给他 - 丹尼 把芯片给他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Give it to him. - Danny, give him the card.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:24.86,1:43:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 给他吧 - 丹尼 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just give it to him. - Danny, come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:36.75,1:43:37.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得仔细看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll have a closer look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:46.34,1:43:48.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我欠你一个道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I owe you an apology.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:48.38,1:43:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,领袖 你应该计划逃脱 好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leader, you should have planned an escape, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:50.76,1:43:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我们俩的事 - 好的 我们两的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is the both of us. - Okay, it's the both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:52.43,1:43:53.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 各位 拜托 - 拜托 别吵了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Guys, come on! - Come on, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:54.02,1:43:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 我救了你的小女友 - 救了我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You, to save your little girlfriend! - To save my…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:56.89,1:43:59.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人用刀逼着她 - 我是骑士之一 你这混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He had a knife to her head! - I'm a Horseman, you dick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:43:59.23,1:44:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 知道吗？现在不适合说这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you know what? This is not the time!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:00.77,1:44:02.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你 你到底瞒着什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you, what's your deal, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:02.27,1:44:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们根本不会流血\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, they're not gonna get blood all over the seats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.48,1:44:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们也许只会 把我们从飞机上丢下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're probably gonna throw us out of the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:06.19,1:44:07.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗？- 很抱歉打断你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - I'm sorry to interrupt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.57,1:44:09.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我得说恭喜你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I just have to say congratulations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:09.74,1:44:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thank you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:12.53,1:44:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:13.83,1:44:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:15.33,1:44:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,是真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:18.54,1:44:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们带过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring them through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:19.67,1:44:20.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说那是真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you say it's real?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:20.83,1:44:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他什么意思？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is he talking about?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:21.92,1:44:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:23.21,1:44:24.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,干的好 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:28.59,1:44:31.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,度玛丽苏香槟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cote Du Marisule champagne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:31.09,1:44:35.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是地球上最贵的一瓶了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the most expensive bottle on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:36.10,1:44:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,120万美金\N{\fnArial\fs30}$1.2 million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:38.31,1:44:42.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我特意为现在准备的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I saved it just for this occasion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:42.40,1:44:46.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话你这酒最多值个七万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, same bottle, Liquor Shack, 700K.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.73,1:44:49.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿你得到了你想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You got what you wanted.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:49.90,1:44:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 你愿意放了我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, does this mean you're letting us go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:52.53,1:44:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,根据你对我们的了解 我们不会放人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knowing what you know about us? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:44:55.54,1:44:59.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你确定？- 沙斯 我们该怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You sure? - Chase, what shall we do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.00,1:45:03.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他们扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Toss them out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:03.25,1:45:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家快速说遗言吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get your last words in quickly, everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:07.76,1:45:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 拜托 不要 - 永别了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! Come on! No! - Farewell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:11.55,1:45:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:15.05,1:45:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 我只想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait! I just wanna say…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:17.52,1:45:19.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我投胎投错了人家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came into the world with the wrong family, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:19.85,1:45:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我遇到了正确的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I'm leaving with the right one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:21.90,1:45:23.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我爱你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you guys!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:23.52,1:45:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:26.40,1:45:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是这样把你踢出来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is how I kicked you out of the womb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:28.90,1:45:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:31.53,1:45:32.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一个是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's next?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:39.04,1:45:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 等等 放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, wait! Let me go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:40.96,1:45:43.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let go of me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:43.37,1:45:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:45.75,1:45:47.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 放开我 - 把她扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me go! - Toss her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:49.84,1:45:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:52.84,1:45:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧搞定 把门关上 这里面好冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up and shut that door! It's getting cold in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:45:55.93,1:45:57.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 上路了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, hit the road, Jack!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:03.48,1:46:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:06.02,1:46:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,头脑发达 四肢简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot of brain, but not enough brawn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:12.07,1:46:13.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that was fun!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:15.95,1:46:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,干杯 干的好 我的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cheers! Well done, my boy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:24.87,1:46:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 真是那味道吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, is it supposed to taste like that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:27.17,1:46:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it is not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:46:48.48,1:46:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:00.03,1:47:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 来接他们吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, come pick them up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:03.00,1:47:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 - 快出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - Come on out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:18.01,1:47:21.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 四骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen… The Horsemen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:42.20,1:47:44.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你应该感觉很好的 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you should feel pretty good about yourself, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:44.54,1:47:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你预料的很正确 泰晤士河 午夜时分\N{\fnArial\fs30}You predicted it correctly. The Thames, stroke of midnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:48.17,1:47:49.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,除夕夜 新年快乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}New Year's Eve. Happy New Year!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:57.01,1:47:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unbelievable!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:58.34,1:47:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都变了 - 我们正在行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We are moving now. - The whole thing just changed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:47:59.76,1:48:02.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 后备待命 - 开始行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All backup into position stat! - We're on the move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:04.02,1:48:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你留在这 - 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're staying here! - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:13.61,1:48:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,行动 行动 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move! Out of the way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:15.53,1:48:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常感谢 伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wow! Thank you very much, London!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:17.82,1:48:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不仅要感谢我们的老朋友 亚瑟·特雷斯勒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We would like to acknowledge not just our old friend, Arthur Tressler.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:22.20,1:48:24.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有他年轻而帅气的儿子沃尔特·马布里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But his young and very brilliant son, Walter Mabry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:24.83,1:48:27.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很好的进行了一场 在我们看来十分优秀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who has performed one of the greatest feats of illusion{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:27.33,1:48:28.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,催眠表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}even we have ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:29.04,1:48:33.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他难以置信的死而复生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has, amazingly, brought himself back from the dead!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:33.34,1:48:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在他做这些之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before he did that, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:36.05,1:48:37.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他揭秘了一些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}he revealed someone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:37.47,1:48:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想我们有权利给他一个适当的介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we think it only right to give him a proper introduction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:42.68,1:48:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我们的朋友和领袖迪伦·施莱克\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is our friend and he is our leader. Dylan Shrike!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:46.77,1:48:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 过来 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get over here! - Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:54.65,1:48:56.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 一般来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, normally{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:48:56.78,1:49:01.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有魔术师本人 他的助手 以及几个舞台助手\N{\fnArial\fs30}only the magician, his assistant, and a few trusted stage hands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:01.57,1:49:03.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道一个把戏的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}know the secret of a trick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:03.87,1:49:06.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是今晚 在这样的影响下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But tonight, however, in this effect, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:06.95,1:49:10.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在泰晤士河附近的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of you people around the Thames here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:10.12,1:49:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们还活着 所以世界各地的人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since we're streaming live, everyone around the world{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:14.84,1:49:17.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,都知道了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}already knows everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:17.42,1:49:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有站在那边的伙计们还不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}And only these fellows here are the ones left in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:21.59,1:49:24.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们就让你们 见识一下我们的表演\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's see how closely you were watching our shows.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:24.60,1:49:28.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得当我们在表演「找小姐」的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when we were playing "Find the Lady, " and I said{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:28.39,1:49:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说我们使用隐形门帘\N{\fnArial\fs30}that we used a Barry Trap.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:31.10,1:49:34.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些经典交换或分身？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some classic switches and a few duplicates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:34.77,1:49:38.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以我们换了卡车的司机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's how we switched the driver of the truck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:41.36,1:49:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们进了早就 设计好的飞机库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which took us to a duplicate hangar{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:43.70,1:49:46.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们利用你们的着急\N{\fnArial\fs30}where we used your need to rush, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:46.33,1:49:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,以及怕被发现的心里 配合我们的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your fear of being seen let you do the work for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:49.41,1:49:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要用灯照着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get those lights off me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:52.50,1:49:56.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 那架飞机 我们怎么让它飞起来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the airplane. How did we get it to fly?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:49:57.84,1:50:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们利用的是风扇 还有灯光和造雨机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we used fans, and lights and rain machines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:07.89,1:50:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明显 这一切的前提就是 我们得被你们抓住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obviously, all of this was reliant on us getting caught.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:12.60,1:50:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们得确保\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we needed to make sure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:13.98,1:50:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们抓住我们后完全按照我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you would do exactly what we needed you to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:16.15,1:50:17.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,安排来\N{\fnArial\fs30}once you did catch us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:17.73,1:50:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的弟弟沙斯 他是失败队伍的技术顾问\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother Chase, who was technical adviser to the losing team.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:23.86,1:50:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,这只是关于盲点的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}He taught us that it's all about blind spots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:26.62,1:50:28.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know where you're going!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:28.24,1:50:31.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, uh, surprises.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:33.66,1:50:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心点 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watch it, hobo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:35.29,1:50:36.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你不看着我戴的手表\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you watch the watch I'm wearing, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:37.04,1:50:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后睡过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}the where of where you're watching, and sleep!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:39.75,1:50:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要把骑士们 从飞机里扔出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to be your idea to throw the Horsemen out of the plane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:43.17,1:50:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你还感到迷惑不解\N{\fnArial\fs30}If all of this is kind of confusing to you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:45.72,1:50:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以之后向你解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can maybe catch you up on it later.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:47.76,1:50:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说呢？也许我们 过个三五年就见到了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Probably see you what, three to five?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:51.35,1:50:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧 击掌吧 嘿 以牙还牙 兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, put it there. Hey! Tit for tat, bro!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:56.27,1:50:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,基本上 我们让他们知道了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Basically, we showed them everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:50:59.32,1:51:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们如何绑架我们 以及偷窃在你口袋里的芯片\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you kidnapped us to steal the very thing that is in your pocket right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:11.83,1:51:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 这个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this thing here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:14.37,1:51:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是你所说的可以 用来整顿市场\N{\fnArial\fs30}which you said you could use to adjust markets, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:17.92,1:51:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,操纵政府 监视任何人的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}manipulate governments, and spy on whomever you choose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:21.67,1:51:23.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, you could, as you said, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:23.59,1:51:26.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以控制民众的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}control the public from outside the grid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:27.68,1:51:32.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些人杀人害命\N{\fnArial\fs30}These men destroy people's lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:33.06,1:51:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,监视整个世界 侵犯你们的隐私权\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spying on the world, robbing you of your right to privacy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:37.19,1:51:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们藏在黑暗中做着这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they do that by hiding in the dark.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:40.52,1:51:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 根据骑士的传统 我们要揭发它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, in the Horsemen tradition, we're here to expose them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:45.15,1:51:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚 他们 和我们大家一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tonight, they, like all of us, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:50.28,1:51:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,终于站到了光亮处\N{\fnArial\fs30}are finally stepping into the light.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:57.42,1:51:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, everybody!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:51:58.67,1:52:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是骑士 我们很快会再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are the Horsemen and we will be back very soon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:03.59,1:52:07.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,五 四 三 二 一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five, four, three, two, one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:24.44,1:52:27.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 我们赶时间 - 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, we're on the clock. - Get a move on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:30.11,1:52:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:31.32,1:52:33.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 里面还有更多 - 你别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's more inside. - Don't you bloody touch me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:33.45,1:52:35.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,骑士们就在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Horsemen are over on the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:37.91,1:52:39.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:40.04,1:52:41.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呆在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay with them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:41.92,1:52:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人散开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody spread out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:44.00,1:52:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,都别离开驳船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody leaves this barge!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:47.76,1:52:50.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗兹 站住 不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rhodes, hold it right there! Do not move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:56.52,1:52:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里面包含了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}This contains everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:52:58.27,1:53:01.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不仅仅是沃尔特和特雷斯勒的事 还有他们所有的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just Walter and Tressler, but all their dealings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:01.44,1:53:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们所有的连络人 整个的生意网络\N{\fnArial\fs30}All their contacts, the entire network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:04.52,1:53:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要相信你？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And why on Earth would I believe you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:06.82,1:53:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉过你 我一直都是那样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. I'm the same man I've always been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:10.57,1:53:13.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 快点 走走走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it! Come on! Let's go, go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:13.12,1:53:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是这个组织的成员 我是梅里特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not part of this organization! I'm Merritt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:15.99,1:53:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被骗了 我被骗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rm a patsy! rm a patsy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:20.12,1:53:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,十分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:23.79,1:53:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在轮到你玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're playing the long game.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:39.73,1:53:41.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸 我保证我会处理好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad, I promise you I will fix this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:42.02,1:53:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不行 别再叫我爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't. Stop calling me dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:44.48,1:53:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上过的女人太多了 根本不知道你是谁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were so many women, I have no idea whose bastard you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:48.48,1:53:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:49.69,1:53:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么回事？- 没看到 不见了 跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What happened? - Thin air, gone. Come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:52.11,1:53:55.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说不见了是什么意思？活人不可能这样凭空消失的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you talking about, gone? People don't just disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:53:55.83,1:53:58.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该知道他根本不会魔术\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize that he doesn't actually have magical powers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:38.24,1:54:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 各位 - 嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, guys. - Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:39.74,1:54:42.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 见到你们真好 - 见到你真好 李\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good to see you all. - Good to see you, Li.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:43.29,1:54:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:47.67,1:54:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,早上好 欢迎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good morning. Welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:52.97,1:54:56.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为你骄傲 为你们骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm proud of you. All of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:54:56.59,1:55:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有很多事要告诉你 来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a lot to show you. Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:01.35,1:55:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:13.94,1:55:15.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:32.59,1:55:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:34.30,1:55:37.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲和我曾是搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father and I were partners.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:37.13,1:55:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的表演充满竞争力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our act was that of rivals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:41.47,1:55:47.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个坚定的现实主义者 而他是爱做梦的理想主义者\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the hard-eyed realist. He was the dreamy-eyed idealist.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:47.19,1:55:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们认为那是最好的组合\N{\fnArial\fs30}We thought it was the perfect misdirect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:50.98,1:55:54.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 在公开场合 我刺激他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, in public, I did goad him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:55:54.74,1:55:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是我们当时没想到 事情会闹得这么大\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only thing we didn't count on was it going so wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:03.58,1:56:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:05.50,1:56:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,为何你从来不和我说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you ever say anything to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:07.33,1:56:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:10.00,1:56:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it a name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:11.38,1:56:14.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为羞耻 内疚 后悔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shame, guilt. Regret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:18.55,1:56:21.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 各位 你们也许想看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, guys, uh, you might wanna come take a look at this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:25.72,1:56:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:27.02,1:56:28.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我把你送进监狱了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put you in jail, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:28.89,1:56:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时为何不说些什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you say something then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:31.31,1:56:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 我本来要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, I was going to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:34.40,1:56:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你之后很快表现出了动机\N{\fnArial\fs30}But then, you were so quick to show your personal motivations that…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:40.32,1:56:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说实话 我被骗到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, quite frankly it spoiled the trick for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:43.78,1:56:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我表现出了我的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed my weakness.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:45.16,1:56:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这证明你没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it showed you weren't ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:48.04,1:56:50.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是当你回到我的牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}But when you came back to my cell, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:50.75,1:56:55.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就已经放下了你对我 长达30年的仇恨\N{\fnArial\fs30}you had let go of your 30-year vendetta against me…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:56.17,1:56:57.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了你的骑士\N{\fnArial\fs30}…for your Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:56:59.22,1:57:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我对自己说 「那才是莱昂内尔的孩子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I said to myself, "That's Lionel's boy."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:04.81,1:57:08.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是我就知道 见证他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I knew it was my job to see to it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:08.27,1:57:11.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,成为一名伟大的魔术师是我的责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he became the magician he was born to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:12.06,1:57:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以剩下的就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that was left then was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:16.15,1:57:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我知道真相\N{\fnArial\fs30}For me to hit bottom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:18.28,1:57:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么那保险箱 我父亲的手表 都是你安排的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the safe, my father's wristwatch, that was all you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:25.91,1:57:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,沃尔特和特雷斯勒也包括在内？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walter and Tressler, were they in on it too?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:29.33,1:57:32.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道沃尔特藏起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, we knew Walter was in hiding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:32.25,1:57:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,演出只是为了让 公众知道他的存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Octa show was a setup to expose him to the public.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:37.67,1:57:41.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对于骑士的想法是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you were right about the Horsemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:41.22,1:57:46.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们得学会像个 有机的整体一样合作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They needed to learn to work together like a single organism.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:53.94,1:57:56.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我知道 你为何看来如此眼熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I know why you look so familiar.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:57:56.65,1:57:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是骑士 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the Horsemen, aren't you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:05.95,1:58:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:07.45,1:58:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是事情不可能这么简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that can't be what all this is about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:09.58,1:58:14.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道 最好的戏法 有着很多的标准\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the best tricks work on many levels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:14.17,1:58:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中最高深的一层 至少对我来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the deepest one, for me, at least, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:18.21,1:58:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是此时此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}is this moment right here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:24.64,1:58:26.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 迪伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, Dylan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:26.80,1:58:29.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想念你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:29.39,1:58:32.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,30年的时间可不短 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thirty years is a long time to drag something around, isn't it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:32.98,1:58:34.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:44.61,1:58:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 现在怎么办？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, now what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:48.33,1:58:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在我想退休了 - 喔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now I'm about out of moves. - Oh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:51.29,1:58:52.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我累了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm tired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:52.71,1:58:55.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 你可是说过要把\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, you're the one who said that you believe that this road{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:55.12,1:58:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些伟大的戏法破解的\N{\fnArial\fs30}led to the great wizard behind the curtain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:57.17,1:58:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:58:58.29,1:59:00.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你终于能当面看清他\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that you'd finally get to look him in the eyes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:01.84,1:59:03.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:09.30,1:59:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your game now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:11.85,1:59:14.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么去做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You play it however you see fit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:15.69,1:59:21.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是建议 你给自己找个继承人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My suggestion, however, is that you find yourself a successor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:21.61,1:59:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 好的 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Okay, so, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:23.57,1:59:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然我们有些问题 对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, obviously, we have a few questions. Right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:26.95,1:59:29.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 他说的几个 大概指的是五百万个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… By "a few, " I think he means, like, five million.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:29.53,1:59:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:31.16,1:59:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good luck to you all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:33.08,1:59:34.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 看到没 那不公平 - 什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay. See, that's not fair. - What!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:34.79,1:59:35.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托 - 那样不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - That's not right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:35.96,1:59:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样我会很生气的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's gonna make me really angry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:37.74,1:59:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:38.58,1:59:40.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, um, by the way…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:42.42,1:59:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要在意那幕布\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pay no attention to the curtain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:47.84,1:59:49.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里有幕布\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is a curtain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:59:49.26,1:59:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:00.10,2:00:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼见为实 但这是真的吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seeing is believing. But is it truth?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:04.53,2:00:07.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,这要看你从哪个角度去看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on your point of view.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:07.24,2:00:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们在听吗 骑士们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you listening, Horsemen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:09.82,2:00:14.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你们出现 你们会出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you emerge, and you will, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:14.24,2:00:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会在那等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will be there waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:17.46,2:00:23.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为记住我的话 你们会得到应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because mark my words, you will get what's coming to you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:23.13,2:00:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是过程让你们无法预料\N{\fnArial\fs30}in ways you can't expect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:26.63,2:00:29.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那是你们应得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But very much deserve.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:29.38,2:00:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我相信一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because one thing I believe in{\r}
Dialogue: 0,2:00:32.60,2:00:36.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,以眼还眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}is an eye for an eye.{\r}
